1
00:00:03,540 --> 00:02:03,540
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:04,085 --> 00:02:08,133
No living being was harmed during the
filming of this series.

3
00:02:09,285 --> 00:02:13,475
Episode 114

4
00:02:14,025 --> 00:02:15,555
Olof

5
00:02:15,645 --> 00:02:17,165
Olof!

6
00:02:17,465 --> 00:02:19,035
Olof!

7
00:02:26,185 --> 00:02:27,955
Olof!

8
00:02:28,895 --> 00:02:32,985
I took the castle you love so much
from you.

9
00:02:33,225 --> 00:02:34,555
Now...

10
00:02:35,465 --> 00:02:38,915
Did you come to beg me to
take your soul too?

11
00:02:39,085 --> 00:02:43,125
I swear I will hang you on
these walls of İnegol.

12
00:02:43,735 --> 00:02:46,885
You will pay for every
drop of blood you shed.

13
00:02:47,015 --> 00:02:48,815
You can't do anything.

14
00:02:50,105 --> 00:02:53,745
Even if you attack me with all your
strength...

15
00:02:54,535 --> 00:02:58,725
You will die under these
walls, Turgut.

16
00:02:58,855 --> 00:03:01,145
Do you think we are
afraid of martyrdom?

17
00:03:01,565 --> 00:03:08,235
I, Turgut Bey, will make this world hard for
you, even if it's the last moments of my life.

18
00:03:17,425 --> 00:03:18,585
No.

19
00:03:18,675 --> 00:03:19,855
No.

20
00:03:19,865 --> 00:03:25,425
You and your Alps will not live long.

21
00:03:26,315 --> 00:03:27,435
My valiant.

22
00:03:27,525 --> 00:03:29,105
Don't worry, my Bey

23
00:03:30,135 --> 00:03:32,005
I'm going towards martyrdom.

24
00:03:32,065 --> 00:03:33,435
Don't do it, Olof.

25
00:03:33,485 --> 00:03:36,015
Don't.

26
00:03:39,285 --> 00:03:40,645
My brother.

27
00:04:00,405 --> 00:04:03,385
Everyone who stands up
against Jesus' army...

28
00:04:03,945 --> 00:04:05,485
I will cut off their head.

29
00:04:05,765 --> 00:04:07,935
This bloody dream that you dream of...

30
00:04:08,165 --> 00:04:10,735
will be the end of you all.

31
00:04:12,255 --> 00:04:18,115
Know that the Turks will fight
until none of you is left.

32
00:04:18,204 --> 00:04:20,005
And we will fight.

33
00:04:20,135 --> 00:04:22,435
Don't waste your breath, Turgut.

34
00:04:22,935 --> 00:04:27,135
You will need it for your
last-minute begging.

35
00:04:29,895 --> 00:04:31,445
Shields!

36
00:04:42,495 --> 00:04:44,075
I'll come, Olof.

37
00:04:44,135 --> 00:04:45,695
I will come soon.

38
00:04:46,015 --> 00:04:49,505
You may hide behind the walls of the
castle as you wish, but I will come.

39
00:04:49,515 --> 00:04:52,105
I will come to tear down
these walls over your head.

40
00:04:52,605 --> 00:04:53,955
Come on!

41
00:04:54,015 --> 00:04:55,405
Let's go!

42
00:04:55,485 --> 00:04:58,245
Let's go.

43
00:05:08,340 --> 00:05:11,390
I hope Turgut Bey does
nothing wrong when he is angry.

44
00:05:11,490 --> 00:05:15,440
We've seen what happened when he's moved
without Osman Bey's knowledge recently.

45
00:05:16,330 --> 00:05:19,420
He won't, especially when it's like this.

46
00:05:21,450 --> 00:05:23,500
Osman Bey is coming.

47
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:29,600
Alps are ready, my Bey, and
they await your orders.

48
00:05:34,620 --> 00:05:36,470
Nobody will move.

49
00:05:37,890 --> 00:05:39,490
Let them wait ready.

50
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:44,420
Olof and İsmihan.

51
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:50,060
Now, they'll think we're
going to attack İnegöl.

52
00:05:51,840 --> 00:05:53,340
But we will stop.

53
00:05:53,580 --> 00:05:55,150
Konur.

54
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,810
Tell us what information
you have on İnegöl.

55
00:05:57,840 --> 00:06:00,480
They took advantage of Turgut
Bey's absence, my Bey.

56
00:06:01,820 --> 00:06:04,360
But this is not the only reason.

57
00:06:05,110 --> 00:06:07,460
It seems that the
traitors are among us.

58
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:10,130
Traitors are on the
job of protecting the castle.

59
00:06:10,370 --> 00:06:12,720
They are the ones
who sell their honor for money.

60
00:06:12,740 --> 00:06:14,100
What are you saying?

61
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:16,210
They let Olof take the castle.

62
00:06:16,780 --> 00:06:18,960
Look at those dog breeds.

63
00:06:21,930 --> 00:06:23,410
Sorry, my Bey.

64
00:06:28,180 --> 00:06:30,100
Ignobles.

65
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,150
Ignobles.

66
00:06:38,570 --> 00:06:41,660
We are fighting a fierce
war with the enemy.

67
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:45,940
My Allah

68
00:06:46,940 --> 00:06:49,630
Save us from the evil of
the hypocrites.

69
00:06:54,410 --> 00:06:55,770
Boran.

70
00:06:56,540 --> 00:06:59,170
You will find them all and
bring them to me.

71
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:01,430
They walk around as warriors, my Bey.

72
00:07:01,930 --> 00:07:03,270
I'll go and see.

73
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:06,550
I will know everyone who put
money in his pocket unjustly.

74
00:07:07,010 --> 00:07:09,130
Then, we will hold them all accountable.

75
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:16,780
My Bey, do you think Olof
and İsmihan move together?

76
00:07:17,690 --> 00:07:19,950
If Olof stays free...

77
00:07:20,690 --> 00:07:23,720
He may have handed his
collar over to İsmihan.

78
00:07:25,900 --> 00:07:29,180
But when my sword
touched İsmihan's neck...

79
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:33,610
I saw in her eyes that she didn't know
anything about İnegöl.

80
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:37,160
Olof may have moved on his own.

81
00:07:38,250 --> 00:07:40,510
Whether he cooperated
with her or he was alone.

82
00:07:40,590 --> 00:07:42,130
It'll be the same in both cases.

83
00:07:42,140 --> 00:07:44,220
What are we going to do, Osman Bey?

84
00:07:45,810 --> 00:07:47,330
Can I come in, my Bey?

85
00:07:48,250 --> 00:07:49,620
Come in.

86
00:07:54,300 --> 00:07:58,090
My Bey, Şamil has sent word from Konya.

87
00:08:17,330 --> 00:08:19,050
Naiman.

88
00:08:19,580 --> 00:08:22,300
He entered Konya with his army.

89
00:08:37,885 --> 00:08:40,515
Jesus' great units...

90
00:08:41,065 --> 00:08:43,424
will be waiting at İnegöl ready.

91
00:08:44,405 --> 00:08:45,975
Turgut.

92
00:08:46,625 --> 00:08:49,695
He'll knock on our door with Osman.

93
00:08:50,295 --> 00:08:55,815
Their anger will make them taste defeat.

94
00:08:55,895 --> 00:08:57,215
If Turgut doesn't attack...

95
00:08:57,235 --> 00:09:00,025
Turgut must have gone
mad with anger.

96
00:09:01,015 --> 00:09:02,385
He will attack.

97
00:09:03,845 --> 00:09:08,945
If they don't attack, we will attack them

98
00:09:09,245 --> 00:09:10,995
What about İsmihan?

99
00:09:11,255 --> 00:09:13,085
What would you say about this?

100
00:09:17,275 --> 00:09:18,865
İsmihan.

101
00:09:23,105 --> 00:09:24,485
Stop.

102
00:09:31,915 --> 00:09:33,115
Olof!

103
00:09:36,015 --> 00:09:40,285
How dare you move
without an order from me!

104
00:09:50,415 --> 00:09:52,115
Mother Sultan.

105
00:09:55,505 --> 00:09:57,555
I've been waiting for you.

106
00:09:58,425 --> 00:10:00,745
Are you waiting for your death?

107
00:10:01,435 --> 00:10:05,025
You will pay for this insolence.

108
00:10:05,205 --> 00:10:07,095
I'm not the one who will pay the price.

109
00:10:07,135 --> 00:10:11,395
It was paid by those who killed
Kantakuzenos and my men.

110
00:10:13,145 --> 00:10:16,575
I broke the neck of those
who don't obey us.

111
00:10:17,455 --> 00:10:19,725
I will continue to do this.

112
00:10:20,995 --> 00:10:22,855
İnegöl is the beginning.

113
00:10:23,685 --> 00:10:26,285
I will take everything Osman
owns from him...

114
00:10:31,745 --> 00:10:33,395
for you.

115
00:10:41,415 --> 00:10:43,865
This place is yours, Mother Sultan..

116
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:57,090
Naiman.

117
00:10:57,705 --> 00:10:59,755
He will rest there first.

118
00:11:02,705 --> 00:11:05,225
Then, he will attack us
with all his brutality.

119
00:11:07,955 --> 00:11:11,445
Osman Bey, how big is his army?

120
00:11:11,465 --> 00:11:13,605
We have eliminated a lot of them.

121
00:11:15,675 --> 00:11:17,275
About 40 thousand.

122
00:11:22,575 --> 00:11:24,875
They outnumber us.

123
00:11:24,895 --> 00:11:26,205
My Bey.

124
00:11:26,725 --> 00:11:27,895
Let's go to Konya.

125
00:11:28,395 --> 00:11:30,555
We reduce their number more and more.

126
00:11:31,365 --> 00:11:34,835
And then, in a place we
know, near Yenişehir...

127
00:11:35,165 --> 00:11:37,465
We gather our strength again
and pounce on them.

128
00:11:37,725 --> 00:11:39,155
No.

129
00:11:39,905 --> 00:11:42,985
This is not a heavy Byzantine army.

130
00:11:44,045 --> 00:11:45,585
They are the Mongols.

131
00:11:46,375 --> 00:11:48,685
You can't survive even if you run away.

132
00:11:51,645 --> 00:11:53,885
Their military units
are just like ours

133
00:11:53,925 --> 00:11:56,975
They must have
mounted archers.

134
00:12:00,245 --> 00:12:01,765
Is there no solution, my Bey?

135
00:12:01,865 --> 00:12:05,485
No, there is definitely a solution.

136
00:12:06,775 --> 00:12:10,165
We trusted solution of those
who didn't have a solution.

137
00:12:12,145 --> 00:12:13,975
Yes, our war is one.

138
00:12:15,295 --> 00:12:17,855
But we are different from them.

139
00:12:20,085 --> 00:12:25,105
Our breasts are filled with faith
and the gentle light of Allah.

140
00:12:27,735 --> 00:12:29,345
- Boran.
- My Bey.

141
00:12:29,355 --> 00:12:31,385
Bring that map.

142
00:12:34,185 --> 00:12:35,735
Bring it.

143
00:12:47,205 --> 00:12:48,745
Now.

144
00:12:54,845 --> 00:12:57,395
40 thousand people.

145
00:12:59,025 --> 00:13:01,535
40 thousand people.

146
00:13:03,155 --> 00:13:07,935
They will get from this point
to here in 5 days.

147
00:13:15,035 --> 00:13:16,755
- Boran.
- My Bey.

148
00:13:18,045 --> 00:13:22,115
Let those who are ready
for martyrdom have units of their own.

149
00:13:23,025 --> 00:13:25,165
They are the ones
who will find the way.

150
00:13:25,515 --> 00:13:27,565
They are the ones who will slow them down.

151
00:13:28,055 --> 00:13:29,635
Your command, my Bey.

152
00:13:29,655 --> 00:13:31,445
We need 7 days.

153
00:13:33,265 --> 00:13:35,765
These units will not return, my Bey.

154
00:13:37,235 --> 00:13:39,795
Let them go out on
their way knowing it.

155
00:13:42,195 --> 00:13:46,935
The existence of great nations is
associated with the horseless heroes.

156
00:13:48,295 --> 00:13:49,775
- Boran.
- My Bey.

157
00:13:49,845 --> 00:13:51,705
Send a message to everyone.

158
00:13:52,585 --> 00:13:54,315
Let the preparations begin.

159
00:13:55,925 --> 00:13:59,425
Will the defense strategy
we are building be sufficient, my Bey?

160
00:14:02,075 --> 00:14:07,885
This campaign is not to stop
them, but to slow them down.

161
00:14:11,305 --> 00:14:16,035
Bala, you'll be at the helm of
the sisters, and you'll dig ditches.

162
00:14:16,145 --> 00:14:19,075
You will control the roads
and cross all the bridges.

163
00:14:19,185 --> 00:14:21,335
Everyone who can do anything
will be with you.

164
00:14:21,945 --> 00:14:23,215
Do not worry.

165
00:14:27,165 --> 00:14:29,255
I will go out on my way.

166
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:36,570
Your soul is in my hands, Olof.

167
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:44,320
If you breathe again
without even asking my permission...

168
00:14:47,460 --> 00:14:56,000
I will bury you and your men in one grave.

169
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:01,620
We'll bury in this grave those who stand
against us, Mother Sultan.

170
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:07,830
You made Osman weak.

171
00:15:08,500 --> 00:15:10,600
I made him weaker.

172
00:15:11,670 --> 00:15:13,990
There's nothing left
but to cut his neck.

173
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:18,700
We'll cut it off when
the time is right.

174
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:21,770
Turgut has come as far
as the walls of İnegöl.

175
00:15:22,510 --> 00:15:25,830
He understood that he would not
be able to take the castle alone.

176
00:15:26,580 --> 00:15:29,460
He will attack with Osman soon.

177
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:35,010
Then I will rip out their livers.

178
00:15:41,650 --> 00:15:46,310
I won't hold you back, Olof...

179
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:55,730
until you bring me the heads of Osman
and Turgut and throw them in front of me

180
00:15:57,280 --> 00:16:05,360
But you will not harm the people
of İnegöl.

181
00:16:06,930 --> 00:16:11,020
I do not stand by those who
cause injustice to the people.

182
00:16:11,590 --> 00:16:18,140
The Christian and Muslim people
of İneöl live in peace.

183
00:16:19,950 --> 00:16:23,810
None of them will be harmed.

184
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:28,780
My Sultan.

185
00:16:32,620 --> 00:16:34,650
What's the matter, Avcı Bey?

186
00:16:36,530 --> 00:16:40,250
Naiman's army has reached
Konya, My Sultan.

187
00:16:49,090 --> 00:16:52,440
Tell me every step they take.

188
00:16:56,370 --> 00:16:58,920
I'm going now, Olof.

189
00:16:59,530 --> 00:17:01,670
Take care of my city.

190
00:17:03,250 --> 00:17:07,480
But my shadow will always be here.

191
00:17:25,358 --> 00:17:27,150
Yakup Bey...

192
00:17:27,700 --> 00:17:29,490
Karesi Bey...

193
00:17:30,220 --> 00:17:31,990
And Candar Bey.

194
00:17:34,110 --> 00:17:36,640
I'll check out all of their states.

195
00:17:38,430 --> 00:17:40,260
And we will make all the tribes revolt.

196
00:17:40,320 --> 00:17:43,120
The love of Jihad in our
hearts is not enough.

197
00:17:44,740 --> 00:17:47,070
We will call all tribes to fight.

198
00:17:48,450 --> 00:17:49,810
However...

199
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:56,310
We'll start first with Candar Bey.

200
00:17:56,820 --> 00:17:59,370
He is the closest person to our cause.

201
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:06,450
My Bey, didn't Candar Bey
express his devotion to the Mother Sultan?

202
00:18:07,350 --> 00:18:09,440
It will be difficult to convince him.

203
00:18:09,540 --> 00:18:14,180
When it comes to the homeland of the Turks,
there is no doubt that he will be next to us.

204
00:18:14,430 --> 00:18:18,010
We have a very important piece in
our hands to convince him.

205
00:18:19,140 --> 00:18:22,670
What if he is not convinced? What if he
doesn't stand behind us?

206
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:27,160
These lands are Naiman's goal, and
few of them will stand against him.

207
00:18:28,810 --> 00:18:34,090
Either we all live or we all perish.

208
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:41,820
We will make it very clear to them that
if we perish, they will perish as well.

209
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:47,640
When they gathered in the palace, they wanted
to be busy with trade, money and gold.

210
00:18:48,340 --> 00:18:52,210
None of them will show
any willingness to resist.

211
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:57,820
My Bey, will the army that will be
formed be able to convince them to resist?

212
00:18:58,970 --> 00:19:03,730
This war will be greater than the war
that will take place on the battlefield.

213
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:07,890
We will make them fight at their will.

214
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:10,930
We will ignite the fires
of faith in their hearts.

215
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:17,070
Then not only will they have been convinced,
but they will have believed in this cause.

216
00:19:18,090 --> 00:19:21,420
When they believe in this cause, they
will not only be able to...

217
00:19:21,585 --> 00:19:25,105
resist the Mongols, but
we will pursue them to Tabriz.

218
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:29,900
We just need to
succeed in this campaign.

219
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:32,310
- Inshallah, my Bey.
- Inshallah, my Bey.

220
00:19:32,530 --> 00:19:34,280
Inshallah, my Bey.

221
00:19:34,450 --> 00:19:36,230
Inshallah, but...

222
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:46,410
What if Turgut Bey attacks İnegöl and
opens another front on us from the west?

223
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:58,650
- Can I come in, my Bey?
- Come in.

224
00:20:03,310 --> 00:20:05,400
Turgut Bey has come, my Bey.

225
00:20:09,150 --> 00:20:10,700
Let him in.

226
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:20,120
Leave me and Turgut alone,
there are things I will talk to him about.

227
00:20:25,650 --> 00:20:28,170
Marmaracık Castle

228
00:20:28,975 --> 00:20:30,815
Allah bless you...

229
00:20:31,925 --> 00:20:33,705
and that marriage.

230
00:20:36,275 --> 00:20:38,855
You two agreed to
marry my sister, Alçiçek.

231
00:20:42,365 --> 00:20:44,395
Thank you, Bayındır.

232
00:20:45,465 --> 00:20:47,055
Thank you.

233
00:20:47,635 --> 00:20:50,835
- May Allah bless you.
- Thank you.

234
00:20:53,035 --> 00:20:58,885
Inshallah, you can hold your wedding before
the forty thousand Mongol soldiers come.

235
00:21:00,085 --> 00:21:03,695
Bayındır, don't talk about bad things.

236
00:21:04,645 --> 00:21:07,785
Mother Sultan is the one who stands
for this good deed.

237
00:21:07,995 --> 00:21:11,285
May Allah be pleased with her.

238
00:21:11,945 --> 00:21:15,015
What would we do if
we didn't have Mother Sultan?

239
00:21:20,645 --> 00:21:26,815
From now on, he's your brother-in-law, of
course, but I'll tell you something.

240
00:21:32,555 --> 00:21:37,535
You know it was all planned by
Osman, right?

241
00:21:41,655 --> 00:21:46,065
He beheaded the soldiers
and brought upon us the scourge of Nayman.

242
00:21:47,955 --> 00:21:49,735
40,000 soldiers.

243
00:21:51,385 --> 00:21:54,755
Our situation will be difficult if
they come to the border areas.

244
00:21:55,125 --> 00:21:57,645
Is there room for this possibility
anymore, Öktem Bey?

245
00:21:57,815 --> 00:22:05,625
Beys of the great Beyhoods
have left after hearing of this.

246
00:22:07,495 --> 00:22:10,065
Who would want to antagonize Nayman?

247
00:22:10,765 --> 00:22:14,295
Osman's arrogance has caused us trouble.

248
00:22:16,155 --> 00:22:18,615
Who's in trouble is obvious, Bayındır Bey.

249
00:22:19,065 --> 00:22:21,155
Osman's head is what will be burned.

250
00:22:21,445 --> 00:22:25,425
Mother Sultan will not allow
the border areas to be destroyed.

251
00:22:26,515 --> 00:22:30,455
She's able to rein in
Neiman and Osman.

252
00:22:31,675 --> 00:22:33,985
She will definitely tell us
what we should do.

253
00:22:36,655 --> 00:22:38,465
Can I come in, my Bey?

254
00:22:40,595 --> 00:22:43,185
Come in, Aybars.

255
00:22:49,265 --> 00:22:51,605
Mother Sultan is coming.

256
00:23:01,335 --> 00:23:02,695
Go ahead.

257
00:23:11,615 --> 00:23:17,145
I went to the place where I'd meet
with my warriors.

258
00:23:18,085 --> 00:23:20,915
But none of them ever came.

259
00:23:23,255 --> 00:23:25,435
And no one came from the castle.

260
00:23:30,675 --> 00:23:32,915
My warriors do not flee, Osman Bey.

261
00:23:34,945 --> 00:23:40,765
And I know that if they are not
prisoners, they are all martyrs.

262
00:23:42,865 --> 00:23:44,445
I know.

263
00:23:46,085 --> 00:23:47,775
I saw them with my own eyes.

264
00:23:47,815 --> 00:23:50,695
Olof has surrounded
the outskirts of the castle.

265
00:23:50,755 --> 00:23:52,275
They even do guard tours.

266
00:23:53,455 --> 00:23:54,555
What's worse is...

267
00:23:55,675 --> 00:23:58,735
that the observers came and told me...

268
00:24:00,195 --> 00:24:01,875
that İsmihan...

269
00:24:02,855 --> 00:24:05,845
went to İnegöl right after us.

270
00:24:07,535 --> 00:24:09,645
She cooperates with
the infidels, Osman Bey.

271
00:24:10,815 --> 00:24:14,845
İsmihan, who used to tell us, "Let's
unite against the Mongols."

272
00:24:16,985 --> 00:24:20,395
It is clear that she has orchestrated
the traitors on the inside.

273
00:24:22,255 --> 00:24:24,395
She went to inegöl in a hurry.

274
00:24:25,205 --> 00:24:26,495
Maybe...

275
00:24:26,495 --> 00:24:31,205
She went to hold Olof accountable for
taking the castle without her knowledge.

276
00:24:36,585 --> 00:24:38,095
Turgut.

277
00:24:38,555 --> 00:24:39,925
Things are bad now.

278
00:24:40,805 --> 00:24:42,895
Things got mixed up.

279
00:24:45,005 --> 00:24:47,405
Even if he took İnegöl
without İsmihan's will...

280
00:24:48,305 --> 00:24:50,625
that will benefit her.

281
00:24:51,345 --> 00:24:54,175
Now, İsmihan and Olof are
waiting for us there.

282
00:24:56,225 --> 00:24:58,095
This is what it looks like.

283
00:24:59,945 --> 00:25:01,255
Let them wait.

284
00:25:02,145 --> 00:25:03,865
But we won't go.

285
00:25:06,125 --> 00:25:07,845
Why won't we go?

286
00:25:08,785 --> 00:25:10,095
We will stop.

287
00:25:12,095 --> 00:25:13,675
We will not attack.

288
00:25:16,945 --> 00:25:19,525
Our standing will drive them crazy.

289
00:25:20,235 --> 00:25:22,105
They'll get mad the longer we wait.

290
00:25:24,485 --> 00:25:27,865
They're used to us always showing up
and fighting them off on some side.

291
00:25:27,895 --> 00:25:29,165
We won't.

292
00:25:29,825 --> 00:25:33,815
As long as we don't fight them, they'll wait
longer to see where we will hit them.

293
00:25:35,805 --> 00:25:37,385
Until when?

294
00:25:37,415 --> 00:25:38,905
Don't worry.

295
00:25:39,045 --> 00:25:40,385
They will be destroyed.

296
00:25:40,395 --> 00:25:42,425
We will destroy them!

297
00:25:45,995 --> 00:25:48,505
What did Allah say?

298
00:25:51,015 --> 00:25:56,815
Yet their various groups have differed
among themselves about him,

299
00:25:57,320 --> 00:26:03,340
so woe to the disbelievers when
they face a tremendous Day!

300
00:26:04,885 --> 00:26:08,305
When they differ among themselves...

301
00:26:08,315 --> 00:26:11,885
Only then will I overthrow
them with the sword of justice!

302
00:26:13,665 --> 00:26:17,225
Justice will not be achieved with
those dogs except with the sword!

303
00:26:20,955 --> 00:26:22,685
When I stop...

304
00:26:23,455 --> 00:26:25,245
You will stop too.

305
00:26:27,805 --> 00:26:29,555
Don't worry.

306
00:26:30,315 --> 00:26:32,115
İnegöl won't stay like this.

307
00:26:33,055 --> 00:26:34,355
Now...

308
00:26:34,685 --> 00:26:37,215
if Naiman comes to us...

309
00:26:37,615 --> 00:26:39,665
and if we act like this...

310
00:26:41,835 --> 00:26:43,665
It will only tire us out.

311
00:26:45,165 --> 00:26:46,465
Yes.

312
00:26:49,915 --> 00:26:52,545
As I lost all those Alps...

313
00:26:53,515 --> 00:26:56,325
I know I don't have a chance for that.

314
00:26:57,495 --> 00:26:58,825
Oh.

315
00:27:00,045 --> 00:27:02,575
Since I moved without you...

316
00:27:03,425 --> 00:27:06,005
Many calamities befell us.

317
00:27:12,715 --> 00:27:14,765
From now on, I will do as you say.

318
00:27:15,285 --> 00:27:17,125
Your command.

319
00:27:18,365 --> 00:27:21,625
Tell me die and I will die now.

320
00:27:28,395 --> 00:27:29,945
Thank you.

321
00:27:32,065 --> 00:27:33,785
I'm going out on the road now.

322
00:27:35,725 --> 00:27:38,285
I will return with a
large army, Inshallah.

323
00:27:48,250 --> 00:27:49,800
Welcome, my Sultan.

324
00:27:49,890 --> 00:27:51,670
Thank you, Öktem Bey.

325
00:28:05,460 --> 00:28:10,640
It seems that the news of the army that
reached Konya has also come to you.

326
00:28:17,020 --> 00:28:19,260
The calamity brought by Osman...

327
00:28:20,340 --> 00:28:21,940
hit us all.

328
00:28:22,450 --> 00:28:25,310
There are 40,000 Mongol
soldiers, Mother Sultan.

329
00:28:27,080 --> 00:28:28,830
Maybe more.

330
00:28:29,520 --> 00:28:33,600
If you collect all the swords in
the border, it will not be equal to them.

331
00:28:35,470 --> 00:28:37,540
Forgive me, Mother Sultan.

332
00:28:38,460 --> 00:28:41,030
But how do we stop them?

333
00:28:42,260 --> 00:28:43,960
What we will do is clear.

334
00:28:44,850 --> 00:28:49,360
We must unite to stop Naiman and his army.

335
00:28:51,570 --> 00:28:54,660
I have the power to secure that union.

336
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:59,020
Öktem Bey, Bengi Hatun.

337
00:28:59,470 --> 00:29:02,060
You two will take care of the caravans.

338
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:09,150
That hungry flock will
attack the caravans first.

339
00:29:10,590 --> 00:29:12,120
Security is important.

340
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:15,960
As you command, Mother Sultan.

341
00:29:17,620 --> 00:29:19,490
What about İnegöl?

342
00:29:20,460 --> 00:29:22,910
We're not going to leave it in
Olof's hands.

343
00:29:23,870 --> 00:29:25,740
If we don't stop Nayman...

344
00:29:25,770 --> 00:29:27,780
we won't not just lose İnegöl...

345
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:31,080
we'll lose everything, Bengi Hatun.

346
00:29:31,420 --> 00:29:32,480
Mother Sultan.

347
00:29:33,330 --> 00:29:36,240
Don't scare us with death so
we can accept concessions.

348
00:29:37,310 --> 00:29:40,700
The homeland is a homeland
and the infidels are infidels.

349
00:29:41,520 --> 00:29:44,060
We're not leaving İnegöl for Olof.

350
00:29:44,290 --> 00:29:45,880
All I've done up to this day...

351
00:29:46,210 --> 00:29:48,240
explains what I will do.

352
00:29:49,360 --> 00:29:51,220
Don't have any doubts.

353
00:29:57,330 --> 00:29:59,650
You can go back to your work now.

354
00:30:03,810 --> 00:30:05,350
Bayındır Bey.

355
00:30:06,670 --> 00:30:08,040
You stay.

356
00:30:18,475 --> 00:30:20,035
What should I do?

357
00:30:20,455 --> 00:30:22,295
Tell me, what should I do?

358
00:30:22,465 --> 00:30:24,475
You will stay here.

359
00:30:24,825 --> 00:30:26,655
Take care of the tribe.

360
00:30:29,355 --> 00:30:31,645
Olof, who will see we
haven't moved yet...

361
00:30:31,645 --> 00:30:33,645
may launch a move.

362
00:30:35,305 --> 00:30:36,855
For this reason...

363
00:30:39,005 --> 00:30:41,585
We cannot lose another property.

364
00:30:42,105 --> 00:30:48,035
I will not allow the infidels to take
another inch of our lands anymore.

365
00:30:48,665 --> 00:30:50,205
Don't worry.

366
00:30:51,105 --> 00:30:53,515
You will return with a
huge army, Inshallah.

367
00:30:53,675 --> 00:30:55,385
Don't worry.

368
00:30:55,885 --> 00:30:57,405
I will go now.

369
00:30:57,505 --> 00:30:59,555
You will go to your duty.

370
00:31:00,725 --> 00:31:04,265
And we will win, Inshallah.

371
00:31:04,655 --> 00:31:06,165
We will win.

372
00:31:14,385 --> 00:31:18,795
You will go to Germiyanids, Jandarids
and Karesi Beys.

373
00:31:20,015 --> 00:31:25,535
You will tell them that Mother Sultan is
preparing a huge army against the Naiman.

374
00:31:29,025 --> 00:31:33,605
I have to know how loyal they are to me.

375
00:31:34,715 --> 00:31:37,235
I can only trust you
for this, Bayındır.

376
00:31:37,775 --> 00:31:39,945
The sun of the upper
Seljuk state.

377
00:31:40,345 --> 00:31:42,545
Mother Sultan.

378
00:31:43,535 --> 00:31:45,915
Don't worry at all.

379
00:31:46,425 --> 00:31:51,465
All Beys will unite
behind you against Naiman.

380
00:31:52,045 --> 00:31:55,195
Bayındır will solve this.

381
00:33:32,335 --> 00:33:33,685
Alçiçek.

382
00:33:33,695 --> 00:33:35,585
Are you going on a mission?

383
00:33:36,555 --> 00:33:37,885
Yes.

384
00:33:39,035 --> 00:33:40,555
What about you?

385
00:33:40,605 --> 00:33:42,415
Ayşe Hatun summoned me...

386
00:33:42,415 --> 00:33:43,665
for wedding preparations.

387
00:33:46,185 --> 00:33:49,255
But I'm afraid that
something bad will happen again.

388
00:33:51,295 --> 00:33:52,875
They say the Mongols are coming.

389
00:33:52,925 --> 00:33:55,745
And İnegoöl is in the hands of
the infidels.

390
00:33:56,285 --> 00:33:57,835
Don't be afraid, Alçiçek Hatun.

391
00:33:59,135 --> 00:34:01,205
We will solve everything, Inshallah.

392
00:34:04,155 --> 00:34:06,245
And we will hold our marriage well.

393
00:34:07,215 --> 00:34:08,745
Inshallah.

394
00:34:09,245 --> 00:34:10,745
Be careful.

395
00:34:11,225 --> 00:34:13,315
Go and come back safely.

396
00:34:15,725 --> 00:34:17,775
I leave such a beauty behind me.

397
00:34:17,864 --> 00:34:20,034
How can I not come back!

398
00:34:22,475 --> 00:34:24,045
Come on.
See you.

399
00:34:33,495 --> 00:34:36,554
Germinyanids
Yakup Bey's Palace

400
00:34:37,485 --> 00:34:39,695
Do you see, Yakup Bey...

401
00:34:39,804 --> 00:34:42,695
the calamity that Osman brought to us?

402
00:34:47,594 --> 00:34:50,264
Fear does not prevent death, Karesi Bey.

403
00:34:51,215 --> 00:34:52,264
You...

404
00:34:52,775 --> 00:34:54,264
Are you on the last frontier?

405
00:34:55,215 --> 00:34:57,275
You should be the last to worry.

406
00:34:57,645 --> 00:35:01,675
Do I only care about the
lives of my tribe members?

407
00:35:02,345 --> 00:35:06,425
All the oppressed will be
crushed by the oppressors

408
00:35:07,485 --> 00:35:12,775
Whoever caused this calamity
is the one who will pay it for us.

409
00:35:14,445 --> 00:35:17,215
Are we going to leave Mother Sultan
alone too?

410
00:35:17,215 --> 00:35:19,215
We will not leave anyone alone.

411
00:35:21,615 --> 00:35:25,145
I will not leave these
lands to the Mongols.

412
00:35:25,495 --> 00:35:28,655
And I will not allow
Osman to gather strength.

413
00:35:29,375 --> 00:35:31,235
How will you do this?

414
00:35:35,135 --> 00:35:37,015
Can I come in, my Bey?

415
00:35:47,575 --> 00:35:51,165
My Bey, the presents
for Commander Naiman are ready.

416
00:35:51,375 --> 00:35:53,245
60 horses will carry them.

417
00:35:53,335 --> 00:35:55,885
We're waiting for your command to get
on the road.

418
00:35:57,455 --> 00:35:59,285
Let them get on the road immediately.

419
00:35:59,685 --> 00:36:03,585
Get to Naiman before Naiman gets
here.

420
00:36:13,845 --> 00:36:17,655
The Messenger himself will
deliver these to Naiman.

421
00:36:18,465 --> 00:36:21,765
May Neiman know well
our respect for him.

422
00:36:22,675 --> 00:36:24,405
Your command, my Bey.

423
00:36:31,645 --> 00:36:32,715
Yakup Bey.

424
00:36:34,845 --> 00:36:38,555
In your opinion, is it possible to get
out of this problem through one letter?

425
00:36:38,575 --> 00:36:41,295
I say we draw swords and fight.

426
00:36:47,215 --> 00:36:49,915
My son-in-law.

427
00:36:52,315 --> 00:36:56,305
When you are young and have a big heart...

428
00:36:56,785 --> 00:36:59,465
You want to solve all
matters by the sword.

429
00:37:00,495 --> 00:37:05,945
But blood is not shed in a matter
that can be resolved by words.

430
00:37:13,575 --> 00:37:16,415
We'll see if the letter will work.

431
00:37:19,095 --> 00:37:22,435
Otherwise, our situation
will be miserable.

432
00:37:24,845 --> 00:37:29,895
But I will not allow Osman
to bring this calamity upon us...

433
00:37:30,055 --> 00:37:33,105
and not to come out of here as a winner.

434
00:37:33,925 --> 00:37:37,925
You take Osman
too seriously.

435
00:37:41,525 --> 00:37:43,065
Karesi Bey.

436
00:37:43,405 --> 00:37:48,985
One day a villager came to the palace...

437
00:37:49,595 --> 00:37:54,125
He looked and found a big meeting
and all the dignitaries were there.

438
00:37:55,435 --> 00:37:57,785
He shouted at the top of his voice:

439
00:37:58,305 --> 00:38:02,235
"I will be the Sultan one day!"

440
00:38:05,005 --> 00:38:07,315
Everyone giggled.

441
00:38:09,025 --> 00:38:11,145
Sultan was the only one who did not laugh.

442
00:38:12,375 --> 00:38:16,885
He was the only one who had
grief, did you know?

443
00:38:20,705 --> 00:38:21,805
What does that mean?

444
00:38:22,595 --> 00:38:27,165
It means that Osman wants
to rule this region.

445
00:38:27,995 --> 00:38:31,455
He wants to be chief of the
tribes and leader of the Turks.

446
00:38:32,405 --> 00:38:39,355
That is, the position he has set his
sights on is not yours to take seriously.

447
00:38:41,945 --> 00:38:44,355
The position he has
set his sights on is mine.

448
00:38:46,545 --> 00:38:50,685
Come on, I made them prepare a
table in honor of your visit.

449
00:38:50,895 --> 00:38:52,235
Let's all sit together.

450
00:39:03,395 --> 00:39:05,405
Köprühisar

451
00:39:08,940 --> 00:39:10,660
Why did you bother?

452
00:39:10,760 --> 00:39:12,340
You can start.

453
00:39:12,530 --> 00:39:15,660
You came from the road, you must be tired.
I'm coming right away.

454
00:39:16,360 --> 00:39:20,720
We are grateful to you.

455
00:39:21,260 --> 00:39:25,870
Let us go now.
Let's not bother you anymore.

456
00:39:25,870 --> 00:39:29,930
No, it is not permissible, you are
my guests now.

457
00:39:30,210 --> 00:39:32,250
I will not leave you.

458
00:39:32,420 --> 00:39:34,730
Come on, start at once and
don't let it get cold, come on.

459
00:39:34,730 --> 00:39:36,240
Thank you.

460
00:39:37,670 --> 00:39:40,030
We...

461
00:39:41,530 --> 00:39:44,970
Cerkutay, here we come to
Köpruhisar, what are we going to do now?

462
00:39:45,170 --> 00:39:46,980
Are you asking what we will do?

463
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:50,040
We'll get out of this house one way.

464
00:39:50,100 --> 00:39:54,390
Let's get out, you, but you talk too
much, that man will not let us go!

465
00:39:54,390 --> 00:39:56,200
Hey says stay and sleep here!

466
00:39:57,340 --> 00:40:01,060
He found a man like me, and
of course he loved me.

467
00:40:01,060 --> 00:40:03,060
Yes, of course he loves you!

468
00:40:04,110 --> 00:40:06,180
Who doesn't love you, right?

469
00:40:08,480 --> 00:40:11,060
Good, well, you're right.

470
00:40:11,140 --> 00:40:16,960
Let's get out of this house as soon as possible,
but how are we going to get rid of this man?

471
00:40:17,060 --> 00:40:18,890
This doesn't concern me anymore.

472
00:40:19,090 --> 00:40:20,580
When my Osman Bey
asks you tomorrow...

473
00:40:20,620 --> 00:40:25,020
You can say "We went as spies but one of the men loved me so much we couldn't get out of the house."

474
00:40:25,070 --> 00:40:27,070
Okay!

475
00:40:38,590 --> 00:40:42,360
- Father! Father!
- Shut up! Shut up!

476
00:40:46,410 --> 00:40:47,890
Cerkutay, leave the boy.

477
00:40:47,950 --> 00:40:50,820
I let him, but he does
not let me.

478
00:40:51,340 --> 00:40:55,060
My son, my little one, leave him.

479
00:40:56,500 --> 00:40:58,720
Father!

480
00:40:59,300 --> 00:41:02,110
Get in, run, run!

481
00:41:03,510 --> 00:41:04,810
My Father.

482
00:41:09,320 --> 00:41:11,360
Father! They're running away.

483
00:41:45,630 --> 00:41:47,630
I have to do this for my sister.

484
00:41:53,950 --> 00:41:57,460
I can't do this, it's too bad.

485
00:41:58,420 --> 00:42:02,690
No, it is not permissible.

486
00:42:02,840 --> 00:42:06,630
You will, Esma. It is the order of
the Mother Sultan.

487
00:42:08,350 --> 00:42:12,310
Don't forget, you're putting poison on
Aladdin's training sword.

488
00:42:12,430 --> 00:42:16,140
When the poison mixes with his blood, the
brother will have killed his brother.

489
00:42:16,180 --> 00:42:17,710
Please, don't.

490
00:42:17,840 --> 00:42:19,470
I told you to do that!

491
00:42:19,560 --> 00:42:23,140
You will set fire to Yenişehir's palace.

492
00:42:23,350 --> 00:42:26,880
Well, what is this poison?

493
00:42:27,220 --> 00:42:28,560
Will he kill him?

494
00:42:28,560 --> 00:42:31,650
It's enough to do what I said, don't
get involved.

495
00:42:32,090 --> 00:42:33,650
And what about Bengi Hatun?

496
00:42:35,690 --> 00:42:37,170
What do you say about this?

497
00:42:37,200 --> 00:42:40,600
The Mother Sultan and Bengi
Hatun know about it.

498
00:42:41,080 --> 00:42:45,640
If you don't do what I say, you
will never see your sister again.

499
00:43:23,360 --> 00:43:25,770
I tidied the place.

500
00:43:25,870 --> 00:43:29,510
Here you go, I brought you a drink, too.

501
00:43:39,260 --> 00:43:41,080
Thank you, Esma.

502
00:43:42,100 --> 00:43:43,480
Enjoy it.

503
00:43:43,510 --> 00:43:45,510
Thank you, Esma sister.

504
00:43:45,560 --> 00:43:46,920
Sit down, brother.

505
00:43:46,940 --> 00:43:48,470
Enjoy it.

506
00:44:11,540 --> 00:44:13,020
We rusted a lot.

507
00:44:15,340 --> 00:44:18,090
Let's practice tomorrow, what
do you think bro?

508
00:44:20,870 --> 00:44:22,240
Let's do it, brother.

509
00:44:38,380 --> 00:44:41,520
Cerkutay this is a dead end.
What are we going to do now?

510
00:44:42,510 --> 00:44:45,380
We'll take care of ourselves, Hatun.

511
00:44:45,700 --> 00:44:48,220
Oh, Ülgen Hatun.

512
00:44:48,870 --> 00:44:50,720
Leave it to me.

513
00:44:58,220 --> 00:45:01,300
I'll solve it now, I'll solve it now.

514
00:45:09,150 --> 00:45:12,430
Stop it, leave it to me.

515
00:45:13,630 --> 00:45:15,710
If we knock, maybe they'll open.

516
00:45:15,750 --> 00:45:17,150
Go away, Hatun.

517
00:45:18,410 --> 00:45:19,930
O Allah!

518
00:45:19,950 --> 00:45:21,490
It's open!

519
00:45:21,540 --> 00:45:23,720
Damn it, are you okay?

520
00:45:29,550 --> 00:45:32,030
Spread fast, find them.

521
00:45:39,150 --> 00:45:41,500
It's a dead end, look everywhere.

522
00:45:46,940 --> 00:45:48,160
Are they gone?

523
00:45:49,910 --> 00:45:51,980
They spread around.

524
00:45:52,280 --> 00:45:55,110
But we have to wait for
nightfall to get out.

525
00:46:01,060 --> 00:46:04,260
Thanks to me, we survived, Ülgen Hatun.

526
00:46:04,310 --> 00:46:06,300
Yes, so be safe, may Allah
be pleased with you.

527
00:46:06,320 --> 00:46:09,040
I don't know how we would have got
through the open door if it weren't for you.

528
00:46:09,050 --> 00:46:10,550
You're welcome.

529
00:46:10,600 --> 00:46:13,100
You are the best spy I've ever seen.

530
00:46:13,130 --> 00:46:14,480
Thank you.

531
00:46:14,580 --> 00:46:16,420
Yes, what are we going to do now?

532
00:46:18,400 --> 00:46:19,780
We'll wait.

533
00:46:21,280 --> 00:46:25,120
We'll find a way
into the castle at nightfall.

534
00:46:25,160 --> 00:46:27,510
You thought that well.

535
00:46:31,780 --> 00:46:33,590
The boy bit me.

536
00:46:34,000 --> 00:46:35,580
Let me look.

537
00:46:36,160 --> 00:46:37,750
Oh! He really did it.

538
00:46:37,860 --> 00:46:39,420
He did.

539
00:46:46,640 --> 00:46:47,940
What did you say?

540
00:46:48,370 --> 00:46:49,940
What did I say?

541
00:46:56,095 --> 00:46:59,635
Olof crossed the line with,
what he did lately, Frigg.

542
00:47:01,685 --> 00:47:03,765
He went out of my way.

543
00:47:04,905 --> 00:47:08,715
He said things I couldn't believe.

544
00:47:09,715 --> 00:47:11,805
He converted to Christianity.

545
00:47:12,565 --> 00:47:18,795
He's going to do all his moves
for the religion of Jesus anymore.

546
00:47:20,795 --> 00:47:24,075
Yes, Mother Sultan.

547
00:47:28,905 --> 00:47:31,125
Damned Kantakuzenos.

548
00:47:34,465 --> 00:47:37,195
All these works are of his own design.

549
00:47:40,645 --> 00:47:44,185
Olof turned his back on Odin.

550
00:47:44,705 --> 00:47:46,795
Who turns their back on Odin today...

551
00:47:47,845 --> 00:47:55,885
turns his back on
you and me tomorrow, Frigg.

552
00:47:57,525 --> 00:47:59,225
Mother Sultan.

553
00:48:01,345 --> 00:48:05,845
Olof gives up on everyone,
but he can't give up on me.

554
00:48:12,235 --> 00:48:14,805
Don't be so confident.

555
00:48:17,785 --> 00:48:21,355
Wasn't he giving his life
for Odin yesterday?

556
00:48:22,745 --> 00:48:24,475
Yes.

557
00:48:29,835 --> 00:48:32,345
Who does not show
loyalty towards his religion...

558
00:48:33,845 --> 00:48:36,405
will never show loyalty to you, Frigg.

559
00:48:39,085 --> 00:48:41,105
Men are like that.

560
00:48:43,085 --> 00:48:46,005
He must have found
a Christian girl by now.

561
00:48:51,195 --> 00:48:52,955
Mother Sultan.

562
00:48:54,535 --> 00:48:56,745
That will be the end of him.

563
00:48:59,405 --> 00:49:01,435
He can't risk this.

564
00:49:03,915 --> 00:49:06,995
You trust Olof a lot, Frigg.

565
00:49:08,185 --> 00:49:12,765
But my opinion is that
he is a two-faced man.

566
00:49:13,765 --> 00:49:19,855
My advice to you is that you
reconsider your loyalty to him again.

567
00:49:23,245 --> 00:49:25,805
I'm saying this for you, Frigg.

568
00:49:31,435 --> 00:49:33,265
You can go now.

569
00:50:01,825 --> 00:50:08,355
Frigg won't leave Olof anymore.

570
00:50:08,905 --> 00:50:15,155
From now on, neither of them
would do anything without my knowledge.

571
00:50:15,645 --> 00:50:18,165
Avcı Bey.

572
00:50:25,595 --> 00:50:28,225
Send news to our Sultan.

573
00:50:28,315 --> 00:50:34,225
He should write a letter to the Beys of Jandarids
and Karasids asking them to be on my side.

574
00:50:34,285 --> 00:50:36,285
He should send it with gifts.

575
00:50:36,475 --> 00:50:42,475
Shall we send gifts to Germiyanids, too?

576
00:50:44,835 --> 00:50:47,515
Prepare my horse.

577
00:50:57,275 --> 00:51:00,825
- Bring it, bring it, let's see.
- Enjoy it.

578
00:51:03,935 --> 00:51:07,555
In the Name of Allah., the Most
Gracious, the Most Merciful.

579
00:51:07,745 --> 00:51:09,765
Aktemur.

580
00:51:10,075 --> 00:51:13,295
Give it to them.

581
00:51:18,405 --> 00:51:20,495
Gürbüz

582
00:51:21,755 --> 00:51:23,465
Wait.

583
00:51:28,305 --> 00:51:30,515
Eat.

584
00:51:33,825 --> 00:51:35,975
In the name of Allah.

585
00:51:36,445 --> 00:51:40,365
Mashallah, it's very tasty, Torahan.

586
00:51:40,395 --> 00:51:42,975
- Thank you.
- May Allah be pleased with you, my Bey.

587
00:51:43,535 --> 00:51:46,595
We became witnesses to
Gürbüz's hunting skill, but...

588
00:51:46,875 --> 00:51:50,435
How did you catch it so fast?
What's the secret?

589
00:51:51,575 --> 00:51:56,455
I watch the separated from the flock, my
Bey, you taught me that.

590
00:51:58,095 --> 00:52:01,475
Yes, you are right.

591
00:52:01,535 --> 00:52:07,055
This is the end of those who do not like
union and think of separation.

592
00:52:07,775 --> 00:52:11,285
The same situation, whether
in humans or animals.

593
00:52:11,485 --> 00:52:15,265
We will not allow anyone to
leave the herd.

594
00:52:15,995 --> 00:52:17,565
Inshallah.

595
00:52:17,815 --> 00:52:20,885
- We will overcome all of this.
- Inshallah, my Bey.

596
00:52:20,945 --> 00:52:22,945
Here.

597
00:52:24,085 --> 00:52:27,125
İnegöl Castle

598
00:52:27,350 --> 00:52:34,440
Accept these gifts from us as a token
of our friendship, Commander Naiman.

599
00:52:38,585 --> 00:52:44,265
From the ruler of İnegöl, the
great Commander Olof.

600
00:52:46,340 --> 00:52:50,400
Get the chests and presents to Commander
Naiman as quickly as possible.

601
00:52:50,530 --> 00:52:58,560
Tell Dan to bring the nuns and the priest
from the monastery in Köprühisar.

602
00:53:01,340 --> 00:53:04,890
I will make this place the
center of Christianity.

603
00:53:09,410 --> 00:53:11,180
Collect the boxes.

604
00:53:20,040 --> 00:53:22,880
I wonder if Odin laughs at you.

605
00:53:26,450 --> 00:53:28,970
Or will he spit on you?

606
00:53:30,400 --> 00:53:32,100
Frigg.

607
00:53:32,650 --> 00:53:34,370
My love.

608
00:53:37,285 --> 00:53:40,965
From now on, I will begin to serve
Jesus' great debt.

609
00:53:41,055 --> 00:53:45,255
I do whatever I have to do.

610
00:53:46,185 --> 00:53:48,375
I sometimes think...

611
00:53:48,745 --> 00:53:51,775
how you have remained
loyal to me until now?

612
00:53:54,185 --> 00:53:58,325
He who changes his God also
changes his lover.

613
00:53:58,545 --> 00:54:00,925
Isn't that right, Olof?

614
00:54:04,545 --> 00:54:07,095
Have I been caught?

615
00:54:08,415 --> 00:54:12,125
Christian girls in İnegöl are pretty...---

616
00:54:15,725 --> 00:54:19,045
You remember what I did to you, right?

617
00:54:21,835 --> 00:54:24,485
Don't trust my love that much.

618
00:54:25,595 --> 00:54:28,625
I ignored your betrayal of your religion.

619
00:54:29,325 --> 00:54:31,525
And?

620
00:54:31,735 --> 00:54:37,795
If you are not loyal to me, you will
not have an eye to see.

621
00:54:42,535 --> 00:54:44,255
Frigg.

622
00:54:45,125 --> 00:54:46,925
My lover.

623
00:54:50,785 --> 00:54:54,435
I got the place Nikola lost back.

624
00:54:54,595 --> 00:55:00,605
I came and took the place
most valuable to the Turks.

625
00:55:02,715 --> 00:55:05,305
All this happened...

626
00:55:10,965 --> 00:55:14,375
by entering into the religion of Jesus.

627
00:55:15,425 --> 00:55:18,235
I will extend my roots here.

628
00:55:22,405 --> 00:55:24,925
Extend your roots?

629
00:55:26,055 --> 00:55:31,985
You spread
your roots on your own, right?

630
00:55:33,825 --> 00:55:37,255
Or with those beautiful
Christian girls?

631
00:55:39,505 --> 00:55:41,535
Together.

632
00:55:41,885 --> 00:55:44,315
Together, my love.

633
00:55:45,075 --> 00:55:47,405
I would never do it without you.

634
00:55:47,885 --> 00:55:50,955
We have Byzantine...

635
00:55:51,295 --> 00:55:54,325
and Mongols to support us.

636
00:55:55,735 --> 00:55:58,145
We will grow up.

637
00:55:58,355 --> 00:56:00,985
We'll grow old, my love.

638
00:56:01,385 --> 00:56:03,765
We will grow up a lot.

639
00:56:08,315 --> 00:56:10,015
A lot.

640
00:56:15,695 --> 00:56:19,565
Jandarids Tribe
Candar Bey's Palace

641
00:56:37,785 --> 00:56:40,485
What is this caftan for?

642
00:56:40,785 --> 00:56:48,675
A Bey like you, who is with Majesty Mother
Sultan and Majesty Sultan Alaeddin...

643
00:56:49,045 --> 00:56:53,165
deserves a glamorous caftan like this.

644
00:56:53,185 --> 00:56:55,085
This is why.

645
00:56:55,665 --> 00:56:57,395
Thank you.

646
00:56:58,315 --> 00:57:00,565
Thank you.

647
00:57:01,425 --> 00:57:03,455
Thank you...

648
00:57:04,595 --> 00:57:07,245
however...

649
00:57:10,765 --> 00:57:14,765
who said we are with them?

650
00:57:17,285 --> 00:57:19,875
You collected gifts in front of me.

651
00:57:20,175 --> 00:57:27,045
How much of this money here is worth the
blood of the fighters when we go to war?

652
00:57:28,775 --> 00:57:33,345
Do they measure everything you have
in gold, Bayındır Bey?

653
00:57:35,595 --> 00:57:38,155
What's this?

654
00:57:38,925 --> 00:57:42,875
Don't talk like you are our enemy.

655
00:57:44,335 --> 00:57:46,115
You insult us.

656
00:57:46,335 --> 00:57:52,425
Our only goal is the future of our
homelands and our followers.

657
00:57:53,285 --> 00:57:57,775
People like you only think
of their own interests.

658
00:57:58,455 --> 00:58:01,345
You don't think about homeland or people.

659
00:58:02,265 --> 00:58:06,105
These are the last things people
like you think about.

660
00:58:09,225 --> 00:58:13,085
Know that you knocked on the wrong door.

661
00:58:16,285 --> 00:58:21,335
Oh, the great Candar Bey.

662
00:58:28,025 --> 00:58:33,635
Yesterday you were waiting at
the door of the palace...

663
00:58:33,905 --> 00:58:37,215
today, you have become the
owner of a homeland.

664
00:58:37,515 --> 00:58:45,335
You can't turn your back on the Seljuqs
who have deigned you with all this.

665
00:58:46,605 --> 00:58:50,335
If you do...

666
00:58:50,715 --> 00:58:56,375
Sultan Aladdin will not forget this.

667
00:59:02,405 --> 00:59:08,385
Are you threatening me in
my presence, Bayındır Bey?

668
00:59:17,175 --> 00:59:24,435
I will now forgive you to show
such manner in front of the Mongols too.

669
00:59:24,505 --> 00:59:26,505
Candar Bey.

670
00:59:26,755 --> 00:59:32,735
Mother Sultan asks you to join
the army she will establish.

671
00:59:32,865 --> 00:59:40,845
You know very well that the Mother Sultan
always gets what she wants.

672
00:59:41,955 --> 00:59:47,235
So, she said, remind him of it if
he will not be persuaded.

673
00:59:50,395 --> 00:59:54,225
Who gave you your country?

674
00:59:58,585 --> 01:00:03,285
Yes, Sultan Mesut gave it to you.

675
01:00:04,505 --> 01:00:11,355
He can take everything you have
in one command as he gave it to you...

676
01:00:14,845 --> 01:00:16,885
Candar Bey.

677
01:00:17,285 --> 01:00:20,335
Don't let me finish the rest.

678
01:00:22,515 --> 01:00:27,545
Don't sleep and die, my Candar
Bey, get up and die!

679
01:00:27,615 --> 01:00:32,425
Participate in the army that
Mother Sultan will establish.

680
01:00:32,785 --> 01:00:36,485
Wave your sword against the
infidels, come on!

681
01:00:36,515 --> 01:00:42,165
I've reclaimed my homeland with the strength
of my wrists and the blood of my brave men.

682
01:00:43,065 --> 01:00:47,225
No one has ever looked to
me for my services.

683
01:00:47,705 --> 01:00:51,945
They called me Yaman Jandar. (yaman=tough)

684
01:00:52,655 --> 01:00:57,875
If you threaten me and try to force me
to do something with threats...

685
01:00:58,115 --> 01:01:01,015
Dig a grave for yourself.

686
01:01:07,125 --> 01:01:08,675
However...

687
01:01:09,805 --> 01:01:15,075
Protecting our homeland
is our job.

688
01:01:18,165 --> 01:01:26,735
I will think carefully and write a letter
to Mother Sultan my decision.

689
01:01:31,355 --> 01:01:33,395
You can go out.

690
01:01:46,255 --> 01:01:48,465
Allah is the greatest.

691
01:02:00,615 --> 01:02:04,285
Peace and mercy of Allah.

692
01:02:04,715 --> 01:02:08,685
Peace and mercy of Allah.

693
01:02:20,185 --> 01:02:25,355
Oh my Allah...

694
01:02:25,595 --> 01:02:29,515
You are the one and you are the one.

695
01:02:29,735 --> 01:02:35,965
Our cause is to spread your
call to the whole world.

696
01:02:36,205 --> 01:02:37,755
My Allah.

697
01:02:37,995 --> 01:02:39,745
My Allah.

698
01:02:39,935 --> 01:02:43,955
- Make our way a victory.
- Amin.

699
01:02:44,075 --> 01:02:49,535
You are the one who will protect us from
the unbelievers, the hypocrites...

700
01:02:49,940 --> 01:02:53,470
and the secret and over traps, my Allah.

701
01:02:53,685 --> 01:02:55,955
We turn to you, my Allah.

702
01:02:56,005 --> 01:02:57,415
My Allah.

703
01:02:58,405 --> 01:03:03,145
Our goal is for the nation to unite...

704
01:03:03,275 --> 01:03:12,785
and to raise your word
and spread it throughout the world...

705
01:03:13,065 --> 01:03:15,775
not on individual issues, but for you.

706
01:03:16,795 --> 01:03:18,615
My Allah.

707
01:03:19,035 --> 01:03:22,515
Our money and possessions
are sacrificed for your sake.

708
01:03:22,615 --> 01:03:23,935
Amin.

709
01:03:24,185 --> 01:03:30,245
My Allah, don't let me and those
who pray to you and...

710
01:03:30,580 --> 01:03:35,960
all believers be seduced by themselves.

711
01:03:36,355 --> 01:03:38,275
Amin.

712
01:03:38,355 --> 01:03:40,245
My Allah.

713
01:03:40,565 --> 01:03:43,665
Make my words count.

714
01:03:44,135 --> 01:03:45,695
Make it effective.

715
01:03:46,475 --> 01:03:51,805
Grant us the strength that enables
us to expel the infidels.

716
01:03:52,615 --> 01:03:54,875
Accept our prayers, my Allah.

717
01:03:54,935 --> 01:03:56,445
Amin.

718
01:04:10,605 --> 01:04:12,375
Amin.

719
01:04:40,805 --> 01:04:42,355
Mother Sultan.

720
01:04:43,885 --> 01:04:46,035
What's up, Celali?

721
01:04:46,525 --> 01:04:48,605
What's Naiman's plan?

722
01:04:49,015 --> 01:04:54,515
As you commanded, we've been watching
Naiman since his arrival in Tabriz, Mother Sultan.

723
01:04:56,315 --> 01:04:57,815
Things are not good at all.

724
01:04:59,705 --> 01:05:02,825
You must have heard of
Naiman's arrival in Konya.

725
01:05:04,435 --> 01:05:05,775
I heard it.

726
01:05:07,715 --> 01:05:11,845
What is the attitude of my son, Sultan
Aladdin, towards Naiman?

727
01:05:12,905 --> 01:05:15,955
Sultan Alaeddin,
for the protection of Konya,

728
01:05:15,975 --> 01:05:18,005
is respectful.

729
01:05:19,255 --> 01:05:27,265
But in order to protect the borders, he tries
to distract him in Konya as much as he can.

730
01:05:28,425 --> 01:05:32,975
Naiman is like a bloodthirsty
wolf, Mother Sultan.

731
01:05:33,145 --> 01:05:37,035
He is not distracted by training
or entertainment.

732
01:05:37,485 --> 01:05:40,205
He wants to walk to the border at once.

733
01:05:42,965 --> 01:05:47,805
I'll have the Beys behind me
before he gets to the border.

734
01:05:48,945 --> 01:05:51,285
What's Naiman's war plan?

735
01:05:51,865 --> 01:05:53,615
Naiman is smart.

736
01:05:54,245 --> 01:05:55,845
He will divide his army.

737
01:05:55,965 --> 01:05:59,585
The army will reach these
lands within days.

738
01:05:59,865 --> 01:06:03,225
But Naiman won't be at their helm.

739
01:06:05,435 --> 01:06:07,045
What does this mean, Celali?

740
01:06:07,755 --> 01:06:12,645
Naiman is the strongest warrior that has
ever come to this land, my Sultan.

741
01:06:14,075 --> 01:06:16,255
He knows that Beys will unite.

742
01:06:17,425 --> 01:06:21,425
In order to stop them, he
will pretend to come...

743
01:06:21,695 --> 01:06:26,375
but he will go north first.

744
01:06:32,275 --> 01:06:37,835
He knows that Beys in the
north have lost their power.

745
01:06:38,385 --> 01:06:40,455
He will destroy the Jandarids first...

746
01:06:40,945 --> 01:06:43,615
and then, Chobanids.

747
01:06:44,865 --> 01:06:50,465
And so, he will destroy us
before we can unite.

748
01:06:52,855 --> 01:06:58,705
Then, we shall win our move before he
reaches the border, Celali.

749
01:07:01,905 --> 01:07:03,435
Otherwise...

750
01:07:10,850 --> 01:07:13,990
There is not a single inch
of land that we give to the infidels.

751
01:07:16,130 --> 01:07:19,150
Until we get İnegöl back, which is ours...

752
01:07:19,680 --> 01:07:21,680
whoever comes before us...

753
01:07:22,120 --> 01:07:23,900
either we die...

754
01:07:24,130 --> 01:07:25,920
or we kill them.

755
01:07:27,930 --> 01:07:30,150
- Acar.
- Yes, my Bey.

756
01:07:30,740 --> 01:07:32,310
What is the status of the Alps?

757
01:07:32,310 --> 01:07:34,310
They you ready.

758
01:07:35,020 --> 01:07:36,360
Good.

759
01:07:39,120 --> 01:07:40,950
Kutan is coming, my Bey.

760
01:07:44,370 --> 01:07:45,720
My Bey.

761
01:07:45,800 --> 01:07:47,920
Tell me about Olof's men.

762
01:07:48,330 --> 01:07:50,590
Are they large in number?

763
01:07:51,120 --> 01:07:52,920
Olof is taking this seriously.

764
01:07:53,170 --> 01:07:55,390
His men are strayed, but...

765
01:07:55,630 --> 01:07:57,350
They are crowded.

766
01:07:57,850 --> 01:08:00,580
It doesn't matter even if
he brings his whole army!

767
01:08:00,940 --> 01:08:02,940
We have no solution but to attack.

768
01:08:04,520 --> 01:08:06,230
Come on valiants!

769
01:08:11,400 --> 01:08:13,750
Kopru Hisar

770
01:08:20,550 --> 01:08:22,319
Why did you come?

771
01:08:22,630 --> 01:08:24,430
I wish I had come alone

772
01:08:24,640 --> 01:08:27,790
I don't know whether to protect you
or gather information.

773
01:08:28,140 --> 01:08:31,158
You should have told this to Osman Bey!

774
01:08:31,859 --> 01:08:33,850
Don't protect me, I'll protect myself!

775
01:08:34,040 --> 01:08:35,609
Protect yourself first.

776
01:08:37,750 --> 01:08:39,800
Come on, come on, come on.

777
01:08:42,868 --> 01:08:45,399
We'll take the priests and monks
from the monastery

778
01:08:45,439 --> 01:08:47,630
Olof is starting his regime in Ingol.

779
01:08:47,979 --> 01:08:51,060
Everything will be reworked.
The church will be repaired.

780
01:08:51,319 --> 01:08:54,649
Get your supplies ready,
we'll take them to Inegol.

781
01:08:54,800 --> 01:08:58,590
To Inegol that we took
from foolish Turks!

782
01:09:14,899 --> 01:09:17,439
Inegol will only be your grave.

783
01:09:18,920 --> 01:09:22,158
What do we do now, Cerkutay?

784
01:09:22,819 --> 01:09:28,529
They even took Inegol while we
still strive here!

785
01:09:28,569 --> 01:09:29,948
Ulgen Hatun.

786
01:09:29,979 --> 01:09:32,198
Hear what I'm going to say...

787
01:09:32,810 --> 01:09:36,140
...before you draw everyone here.

788
01:09:37,520 --> 01:09:40,359
Osman Bey knew the tricks
played by the infidels

789
01:09:41,060 --> 01:09:43,140
Our plan changed.

790
01:09:43,510 --> 01:09:45,550
We're going to Inegol now.

791
01:09:46,290 --> 01:09:48,810
But Osman Bey ordered us to
go to Kopruhisar.

792
01:09:49,029 --> 01:09:51,890
The infidels were all in
Kopruhisar back then.

793
01:09:52,238 --> 01:09:54,690
Now they're in Inegol.

794
01:09:55,430 --> 01:09:57,860
Our mission here is over.

795
01:09:58,360 --> 01:10:01,380
Good, but how do we enter Inegol?

796
01:10:05,220 --> 01:10:07,270
We need two robes.

797
01:10:07,610 --> 01:10:10,120
A robe of nun and a priest.

798
01:10:10,400 --> 01:10:11,740
Okay.

799
01:10:11,810 --> 01:10:13,110
Let's go.

800
01:11:43,875 --> 01:11:46,425
Olof will take your life.

801
01:11:51,615 --> 01:11:53,175
Don't you worry.

802
01:12:00,255 --> 01:12:01,585
Soon.

803
01:12:02,145 --> 01:12:03,935
He will end up like you.

804
01:12:10,255 --> 01:12:12,335
Neiman's coming from the east.

805
01:12:12,815 --> 01:12:17,185
Even if he surrounds us,
we won't leave Olof alone

806
01:12:17,825 --> 01:12:19,895
The moment he walks out of the castle...

807
01:12:20,325 --> 01:12:23,135
...we'll deny his life!

808
01:12:24,315 --> 01:12:25,875
Come on, alps!

809
01:12:44,550 --> 01:12:48,350
Oh Allah, forgive me, Allah.

810
01:12:50,120 --> 01:12:51,650
I can't stand it

811
01:12:51,930 --> 01:12:54,490
Don't let a brother kill his brother, Esma.

812
01:13:06,150 --> 01:13:07,480
Brother.

813
01:13:18,080 --> 01:13:19,640
I'm fine brother

814
01:13:19,770 --> 01:13:21,300
It's a small scratch.

815
01:13:22,510 --> 01:13:24,080
Hey, let's continue.

816
01:13:51,050 --> 01:13:52,760
Drink this, brother

817
01:14:17,020 --> 01:14:18,800
I'm fine brother.

818
01:14:58,990 --> 01:15:00,500
Aladdin.

819
01:15:00,550 --> 01:15:02,280
I can't move my hand.

820
01:15:06,470 --> 01:15:09,500
Brother, your hand is hot as fire

821
01:15:10,840 --> 01:15:13,170
Come on, let's see
Kumral Abdal right away!

822
01:15:13,530 --> 01:15:16,110
Come on, come on.

823
01:15:28,450 --> 01:15:29,840
What will happen?

824
01:15:31,040 --> 01:15:32,570
What will the poison do?

825
01:15:35,990 --> 01:15:39,120
Do you think Candar Bey
will be with us, my Bey?

826
01:15:40,330 --> 01:15:42,510
Candar is the weakest link.

827
01:15:43,370 --> 01:15:45,300
I saw it in his eyes

828
01:15:45,520 --> 01:15:46,750
He is never afraid

829
01:15:46,750 --> 01:15:48,520
He trusts his alps.

830
01:15:49,260 --> 01:15:51,060
He heard of Nayman, but...

831
01:15:51,670 --> 01:15:54,220
...he doesn't care at all.

832
01:16:01,050 --> 01:16:03,100
He must have a secret power, my Bey.

833
01:16:03,220 --> 01:16:06,310
Otherwise, why would
he speak so fearlessly?

834
01:16:06,820 --> 01:16:08,680
I do not know about that.

835
01:16:11,140 --> 01:16:17,180
All I know is if Osman cooperates with him...

836
01:16:17,400 --> 01:16:22,540
Mother Sultan will cut off our heads.

837
01:16:24,040 --> 01:16:25,840
What are we going to do, my Bey?

838
01:16:27,900 --> 01:16:31,440
It doesn't matter if he manages
to convince Candar or not.

839
01:16:32,230 --> 01:16:35,840
As long as Karasi and Germiyan
are with us...

840
01:16:36,230 --> 01:16:39,050
Candar is of no importance at all.

841
01:16:39,880 --> 01:16:42,760
We will save our heads

842
01:16:44,020 --> 01:16:46,420
We'll convince them first.

843
01:16:47,760 --> 01:16:48,970
No.

844
01:16:49,440 --> 01:16:54,290
Rather, we will prevent Osman
from convincing them.

845
01:17:00,380 --> 01:17:05,010
Karasi Bey's son-in-law.
What was his name?

846
01:17:05,120 --> 01:17:07,120
Uslu.
Uslu Bey.

847
01:17:07,590 --> 01:17:10,150
Yes, Uslu Bey.

848
01:17:14,600 --> 01:17:20,070
Let's see if Karasi Bey will agree
to work with Osman...

849
01:17:20,710 --> 01:17:26,110
...when he hears his son-in-law
is killed by Osman.

850
01:17:28,140 --> 01:17:30,760
You are going to set a fire,
huh my Bey?

851
01:17:31,520 --> 01:17:33,180
Fire it is.

852
01:17:34,030 --> 01:17:35,810
Fire it is.

853
01:17:36,500 --> 01:17:45,540
It's going to be such a fire...
We will throw dry woods in that fire.

854
01:17:50,220 --> 01:17:53,240
Candarogullari Beyship
Candar Bey's Mansion

855
01:17:58,340 --> 01:18:00,060
Our armies are getting ready...

856
01:18:02,130 --> 01:18:03,710
And when the time comes...

857
01:18:04,290 --> 01:18:06,850
...under the command of Mother Sultan...

858
01:18:07,300 --> 01:18:09,390
Can I come in, my Bey?

859
01:18:13,890 --> 01:18:15,270
Come!

860
01:18:21,050 --> 01:18:23,610
Osman Bey arrived.
He wants to talk.

861
01:18:29,670 --> 01:18:32,670
In difficult times the demand for
the brave increases.

862
01:18:39,800 --> 01:18:41,360
Let the letter wait.

863
01:18:42,710 --> 01:18:44,390
Let's listen to Osman Bey.

864
01:18:45,410 --> 01:18:46,790
Let him come.

865
01:18:56,680 --> 01:18:58,210
Peace be upon you.

866
01:18:58,860 --> 01:19:00,880
Peace be upon you too, Osman Bey.

867
01:19:01,510 --> 01:19:04,640
-Welcome.
-Thank you.

868
01:19:05,870 --> 01:19:07,420
Thank you.

869
01:19:08,000 --> 01:19:10,060
What do we owe this pleasure?

870
01:19:10,600 --> 01:19:12,630
Bayindir Bey, who came before us...

871
01:19:13,750 --> 01:19:16,860
...must have told you
the reason for our visit.

872
01:19:19,120 --> 01:19:23,180
And you also came to tell me
to support Mother Sultan then?

873
01:19:28,160 --> 01:19:29,530
No.

874
01:19:32,340 --> 01:19:34,120
I want you to support me.

875
01:19:38,580 --> 01:19:40,120
What a shame.

876
01:19:40,630 --> 01:19:43,310
Bayindir Bey at least offered presentsç

877
01:19:44,140 --> 01:19:47,720
As for you, you came empty-handed and
with a commanding tongue

878
01:19:48,660 --> 01:19:50,190
Too bad.

879
01:19:53,230 --> 01:19:55,440
I see they showered you with gifts.

880
01:19:59,490 --> 01:20:02,300
Thinking they will buy your army.

881
01:20:03,650 --> 01:20:05,230
They covered you with gold.

882
01:20:09,640 --> 01:20:11,230
In addition...

883
01:20:11,830 --> 01:20:13,850
They think they will take advantage of you.

884
01:20:15,870 --> 01:20:17,730
They dressed you in a luxurious caftan

885
01:20:18,750 --> 01:20:20,250
Osman Bey!

886
01:20:44,985 --> 01:20:48,545
Thank Allah I've got everything ready
for my Alcicek.

887
01:20:51,585 --> 01:20:54,085
...don't get me wrong, Ayse Hatun...

888
01:20:55,305 --> 01:20:58,735
...but I guess you haven't had any
preparaitons for Aktemur's marriage.

889
01:21:03,105 --> 01:21:04,675
Bengi Hatun.

890
01:21:06,055 --> 01:21:08,425
I sewed them all
one by one with my own hands.

891
01:21:09,805 --> 01:21:12,385
Paying money and buying them
from the market is easy.

892
01:21:14,125 --> 01:21:16,935
I sewed my son's supplies
with my own hands.

893
01:21:21,165 --> 01:21:23,195
Bless you, Ayse Hatun.

894
01:21:23,275 --> 01:21:24,985
They are all very beautiful.

895
01:21:25,125 --> 01:21:26,915
Thank you, my daughter.

896
01:21:29,345 --> 01:21:31,435
They are all so beautiful.

897
01:21:31,535 --> 01:21:33,395
Esma, collect them.

898
01:21:35,355 --> 01:21:37,405
Our daughter Alcicek liked it too.

899
01:21:38,755 --> 01:21:40,835
Thank you for your efforts, my Ayse!

900
01:21:42,325 --> 01:21:46,085
As long as hearts are connected,
other shortcomings will surely be handled.

901
01:21:47,415 --> 01:21:49,495
Why would you say that, Bengi Hatun?

902
01:22:01,795 --> 01:22:03,865
I'll go for a fresh air.

903
01:22:07,805 --> 01:22:09,185
Mother!

904
01:22:09,345 --> 01:22:10,905
Aladdin, what happened?

905
01:22:11,805 --> 01:22:13,995
- My brother.
- What happened to your brother?

906
01:22:17,805 --> 01:22:20,345
Orhan!
Orhan, what happened?

907
01:22:20,745 --> 01:22:23,295
It's nothing, mother.
Don't worry.

908
01:22:23,895 --> 01:22:25,635
Aladdin is exaggerating.

909
01:22:25,645 --> 01:22:27,395
How did this happen?

910
01:22:27,655 --> 01:22:29,455
I injured him during the training.

911
01:22:31,375 --> 01:22:33,155
It's not important, brother.

912
01:22:33,395 --> 01:22:35,255
But his forearm burns like fire.

913
01:22:36,555 --> 01:22:38,405
He can't even hold a sword.

914
01:22:44,605 --> 01:22:46,105
Malhun.

915
01:22:46,225 --> 01:22:48,305
This can't be caused by a sword.

916
01:22:49,555 --> 01:22:51,325
There must be something else.

917
01:22:51,335 --> 01:22:52,865
What is that?

918
01:22:55,895 --> 01:22:57,735
Poison?

919
01:23:02,725 --> 01:23:05,515
The weapon wound cannot shape
like this in a short time.

920
01:23:07,075 --> 01:23:08,865
Call Kumral Abdal at once.

921
01:23:08,905 --> 01:23:10,665
Aladdin, son.

922
01:23:10,685 --> 01:23:13,935
Bring your sword but don't touch
the blade, okay?

923
01:23:16,735 --> 01:23:20,235
My Orhan, come sit here.

924
01:23:21,005 --> 01:23:22,815
Did you do this?

925
01:23:36,095 --> 01:23:37,635
Candar Bey.

926
01:23:44,025 --> 01:23:45,575
I appreciate you.

927
01:23:47,285 --> 01:23:48,995
And I know how great you are.

928
01:23:51,055 --> 01:23:52,105
I know that...

929
01:23:53,025 --> 01:23:57,445
Candar Bey cannot be deceived by
gold or caftan.

930
01:24:00,555 --> 01:24:04,085
A faithful one cannot be deceived.

931
01:24:11,295 --> 01:24:13,815
I want you to fight with me
against the infidels.

932
01:24:16,545 --> 01:24:18,065
What do they want?

933
01:24:18,745 --> 01:24:22,315
Do they have other intentions other than
fighting the infidels?

934
01:24:24,225 --> 01:24:25,955
And they're creating an army, too.

935
01:24:26,405 --> 01:24:29,105
Everyone is looking
to strengthen themselves!

936
01:24:32,385 --> 01:24:33,965
You are correct.

937
01:24:34,815 --> 01:24:36,395
I want to be stronger.

938
01:24:38,215 --> 01:24:40,225
But I don't want to be rich like they do.

939
01:24:41,155 --> 01:24:42,975
Did you hear the latest events?

940
01:24:45,205 --> 01:24:47,025
I lost my castles.

941
01:24:50,845 --> 01:24:53,915
Inegol, Yenisehir...

942
01:24:55,205 --> 01:24:56,955
And Sogut.

943
01:24:58,865 --> 01:25:00,735
I lost all of them.

944
01:25:05,185 --> 01:25:07,015
After all those conquests...

945
01:25:08,935 --> 01:25:10,765
...I came back to my tents.

946
01:25:13,815 --> 01:25:15,165
Why?

947
01:25:16,825 --> 01:25:18,545
Tell me, why?

948
01:25:21,945 --> 01:25:23,785
Not to bow down to Mother Sultan.

949
01:25:26,235 --> 01:25:28,115
If I obeyed her...

950
01:25:28,775 --> 01:25:31,855
...I would have been richer
and wealthier.

951
01:25:35,075 --> 01:25:36,995
If my only aim was money and power...

952
01:25:38,315 --> 01:25:40,225
...I wouldn't choose this way.

953
01:25:45,395 --> 01:25:48,235
I am not the same with them.

954
01:25:50,345 --> 01:25:54,065
I am a Turkish Bey who thinks only of
the interest of the innocents.

955
01:25:55,895 --> 01:25:57,455
And I...

956
01:25:59,745 --> 01:26:01,585
I consider you one of us.

957
01:26:05,625 --> 01:26:08,145
For this reason,
I am asking you to stand with me.

958
01:26:10,925 --> 01:26:12,725
Supporting you means...

959
01:26:13,725 --> 01:26:16,775
...confronting Sultan Aladdin
with everything he has

960
01:26:17,635 --> 01:26:19,695
What about Germiyan?
What about Karasi?

961
01:26:20,215 --> 01:26:22,025
What if they choose the opposite?

962
01:26:22,825 --> 01:26:24,635
If they choose the opposite...

963
01:26:24,715 --> 01:26:27,825
I will only be joining your loneliness,
Osman Bey.

964
01:26:29,725 --> 01:26:31,295
The path is tough.

965
01:26:33,165 --> 01:26:35,665
Few heroes walk these paths.

966
01:26:37,405 --> 01:26:39,205
You need a decision.

967
01:26:39,705 --> 01:26:41,005
Tell me.

968
01:26:42,535 --> 01:26:44,605
Are you loyal to...

969
01:26:46,065 --> 01:26:47,875
Sultan Aladdin?

970
01:26:48,985 --> 01:26:50,815
Or are you loyal to Sultan Mesut?

971
01:26:53,335 --> 01:26:56,175
The one who gave you
everything is Sultan Mesut.

972
01:26:59,145 --> 01:27:01,965
You sound like Bayindir Bey.

973
01:27:02,775 --> 01:27:04,605
Sultan Mesut is dead.

974
01:27:05,095 --> 01:27:07,275
There is no one left who can protect you.

975
01:27:07,675 --> 01:27:11,005
Sultan Aladdin will end you.

976
01:27:11,765 --> 01:27:13,815
No, no.

977
01:27:17,525 --> 01:27:19,085
They lie to you.

978
01:27:20,355 --> 01:27:21,645
Sultan Mesut is alive.

979
01:27:24,545 --> 01:27:26,635
He asks you to support me.

980
01:27:30,515 --> 01:27:31,595
Prove it.

981
01:27:38,885 --> 01:27:40,245
Here.

982
01:27:43,235 --> 01:27:44,735
This ring.

983
01:27:47,575 --> 01:27:53,135
You must have seen this ring
when you kissed Sultan Mesut's hand.

984
01:28:08,705 --> 01:28:11,855
The future of your Beyship
depends on the decision you will make.

985
01:28:13,165 --> 01:28:17,335
You need Sultan Mesut
on this difficult path.

986
01:28:20,075 --> 01:28:25,295
Sultan Mesut also said he'd support you
in the conquest of Kastamonu...

987
01:28:25,295 --> 01:28:29,615
...which you have beeen dreaming to have.

988
01:28:35,485 --> 01:28:37,055
Now...

989
01:28:40,685 --> 01:28:42,715
Will you stand on the side of falsehood...

990
01:28:46,165 --> 01:28:48,325
...or on the right side?

991
01:29:09,475 --> 01:29:11,245
Make up your mind.

992
01:29:57,245 --> 01:29:59,105
Burn this caftan!

993
01:30:00,805 --> 01:30:02,915
Don't let his misfortune spread among us!

994
01:30:03,455 --> 01:30:05,015
Your command, my Bey!

995
01:30:12,985 --> 01:30:16,035
Wait, Malhun, let's care Orhan,
now is not the time

996
01:30:16,085 --> 01:30:19,355
- I ask you! Did you do this?
- Stop it, Malhun Hatun.

997
01:30:19,875 --> 01:30:21,405
Why would I do this?

998
01:30:21,465 --> 01:30:23,005
Why would I be here then?

999
01:30:23,015 --> 01:30:26,015
I thought there was no enmity between
us anymore! I gave you my daughter!

1000
01:30:28,435 --> 01:30:30,785
If you come out behind this...

1001
01:30:31,515 --> 01:30:34,535
I swear to you that I will kill you myself.

1002
01:30:35,095 --> 01:30:37,475
I didn't do it.

1003
01:30:42,695 --> 01:30:45,255
Now leave me alone
and take care of your son.

1004
01:30:51,015 --> 01:30:53,545
Hurry up, Komral Abdul!

1005
01:30:57,875 --> 01:31:00,585
Tell me, what's his situation, Komral Abdul?

1006
01:31:04,325 --> 01:31:06,595
- Where's the sword?
- Here.

1007
01:31:08,825 --> 01:31:10,335
Orhan.

1008
01:31:37,625 --> 01:31:39,455
What happened, Komral Abdul?

1009
01:31:41,555 --> 01:31:43,085
The sword is poisoned

1010
01:31:55,425 --> 01:31:56,995
But I'm fine.

1011
01:31:57,045 --> 01:32:00,135
There is no pain,
I just feel like my hand is burning

1012
01:32:04,905 --> 01:32:06,905
The poison is spreading, Orhan Bey.

1013
01:32:07,335 --> 01:32:09,855
But it will show its effects slowly.

1014
01:32:11,225 --> 01:32:14,475
We don't know how it will affect you.

1015
01:32:14,965 --> 01:32:17,715
You'll be fine, son, you'll be fine.

1016
01:32:40,195 --> 01:32:42,075
We don't have much time left.

1017
01:32:42,675 --> 01:32:47,195
My Bey, if we go through the valley,
we will buy more time

1018
01:32:48,475 --> 01:32:51,995
- Lead the way, we'll follow you.
- Yes my Bey.

1019
01:33:05,595 --> 01:33:09,125
Enough, Bengi Hatun, I've had enough

1020
01:33:09,575 --> 01:33:11,305
Kill me so that I get rid of this!

1021
01:33:11,355 --> 01:33:14,355
Wait Esma, what the hell?

1022
01:33:14,535 --> 01:33:17,305
I told what you said!
You saw it!

1023
01:33:19,125 --> 01:33:21,715
How are we going to pay
for this sin?

1024
01:33:22,085 --> 01:33:24,505
What are you saying, Esma?
I do not understand anything!

1025
01:33:24,505 --> 01:33:26,815
What did you do?
What does it have to do with me?

1026
01:33:26,815 --> 01:33:28,365
Why are you playing the fool?

1027
01:33:28,475 --> 01:33:30,995
You said you didn't do it there!

1028
01:33:33,395 --> 01:33:35,475
But you gave me the order.

1029
01:33:37,175 --> 01:33:39,225
I put that poison.

1030
01:33:40,965 --> 01:33:42,515
Silent!

1031
01:33:42,795 --> 01:33:44,105
Silent!

1032
01:33:44,235 --> 01:33:46,915
Do you hear what you're saying, Esma?

1033
01:33:49,045 --> 01:33:53,625
Now lower your voice and
explain this well.

1034
01:33:54,135 --> 01:33:55,145
What happened?

1035
01:33:55,795 --> 01:33:57,145
Come on.

1036
01:33:57,975 --> 01:34:01,305
How is this possible?
How do you not know?

1037
01:34:01,305 --> 01:34:02,675
Know what?

1038
01:34:03,605 --> 01:34:06,855
- But they told me that you...
- What?

1039
01:34:06,855 --> 01:34:08,885
- They said you wanted this?
- I wanted what?

1040
01:34:09,925 --> 01:34:14,245
Avci Bey came and he said he'd kill my brother
if I don't do what he says.

1041
01:34:14,635 --> 01:34:17,175
He said Bengi Hatun wanted it.

1042
01:34:21,445 --> 01:34:23,295
Ismihan.

1043
01:34:24,475 --> 01:34:26,745
Ismihan.

1044
01:34:27,875 --> 01:34:30,405
He'll be fine, won't he, Kumaral Abdul?

1045
01:34:32,340 --> 01:34:34,040
If Allah permits.

1046
01:34:34,270 --> 01:34:37,590
If we find the poison,
we will also find the cure.

1047
01:34:40,030 --> 01:34:42,910
We will definitely find it.

1048
01:34:46,150 --> 01:34:48,670
I sent Alcicek and Bengi.

1049
01:34:53,780 --> 01:34:55,780
If this wasn't Bengi Hatun...

1050
01:34:56,880 --> 01:35:00,470
...who was it to come into our tent
and put the prison on the sword?

1051
01:35:04,560 --> 01:35:06,930
Who would dare do such a thing?

1052
01:35:07,060 --> 01:35:09,630
Only Ismahan can do this.

1053
01:35:11,470 --> 01:35:12,970
But how?

1054
01:35:14,180 --> 01:35:16,400
Obviously, there is a traitor among us.

1055
01:35:19,870 --> 01:35:21,190
Yes there is.

1056
01:35:22,160 --> 01:35:24,670
Did someone enter the tent
without your consent, Aladdin?

1057
01:35:24,880 --> 01:35:26,380
Think well.

1058
01:35:29,840 --> 01:35:31,890
Is there someone you suspect?

1059
01:35:49,030 --> 01:35:52,550
My Orhan, haven't you seen anyone?

1060
01:35:57,940 --> 01:35:59,300
No.

1061
01:36:04,000 --> 01:36:05,790
It happened because of me

1062
01:36:10,830 --> 01:36:13,490
No son, not because of you

1063
01:36:14,080 --> 01:36:16,910
...they're trying to
set us against each other, but...

1064
01:36:17,990 --> 01:36:19,550
We are going to spoil this game.

1065
01:36:19,870 --> 01:36:21,410
You will be fine.

1066
01:36:30,190 --> 01:36:31,710
Give it to me, brother.

1067
01:36:35,190 --> 01:36:37,750
Come on, drink a little.

1068
01:36:44,800 --> 01:36:46,520
What's going on, Orhan?

1069
01:36:53,090 --> 01:36:54,480
Mother.

1070
01:36:55,330 --> 01:36:57,170
I can't raise my hand, mother.

1071
01:37:04,110 --> 01:37:05,460
Mother.

1072
01:37:10,400 --> 01:37:11,990
Kumral Abdal.

1073
01:37:12,980 --> 01:37:16,230
Do something Kumral Abdal!
Kumral Abdal I don't feel my arm!

1074
01:37:16,420 --> 01:37:18,770
- Kumral Abdal!
- Do something Kumral Abdal.

1075
01:37:18,980 --> 01:37:20,540
Kumral Abdal!

1076
01:37:23,310 --> 01:37:25,140
I don't feel it, Kumral Abdal!

1077
01:37:34,480 --> 01:37:36,310
I don't feel it, Kumral Abdal!

1078
01:37:36,370 --> 01:37:38,500
Will I ever hold sword again?

1079
01:37:38,500 --> 01:37:40,100
Mother!
Mother Bala!

1080
01:37:40,150 --> 01:37:42,100
Will I ever hold sword again, mother?

1081
01:37:42,340 --> 01:37:45,350
Mother, where are you going?
Mother!!

1082
01:37:45,350 --> 01:37:47,790
- Say something mother!
- Hold on my valiant!

1083
01:37:47,790 --> 01:37:50,910
-Don't leave me like this, Mother Bala!
-We'll find a way.

1084
01:37:51,250 --> 01:37:52,840
Heal me!

1085
01:37:52,840 --> 01:37:55,290
- We'll find the cure.
- Say something mother!

1086
01:37:55,290 --> 01:37:58,280
Mother!
Bala Mother! Don't let this happen!

1087
01:37:58,390 --> 01:38:00,150
Calm down, Orhan.

1088
01:38:00,150 --> 01:38:01,930
Don't let it happen, Kumral Abdal!

1089
01:38:01,930 --> 01:38:03,590
Kumral Abdal!

1090
01:38:03,590 --> 01:38:05,130
Mother!

1091
01:38:05,580 --> 01:38:08,700
Karasiogugullari Beyship
Karesi Mansion

1092
01:38:36,140 --> 01:38:38,200
Osman Bey, the rebel Bey.

1093
01:38:40,200 --> 01:38:42,990
What brings you to our land?

1094
01:38:46,490 --> 01:38:51,660
Or are you seeking protection
from the Mongols?

1095
01:38:54,010 --> 01:38:56,630
Man does not run away from fight.

1096
01:38:58,860 --> 01:39:03,550
Rather, we stand like iron in front of
those who brought fire to this earth

1097
01:39:08,540 --> 01:39:11,630
We do not bow our heads,
we make them bow.

1098
01:39:12,190 --> 01:39:15,610
They say the Mongols have reached
Konya, Osman Bey.

1099
01:39:16,700 --> 01:39:20,590
Let's see if you can keep this manner
in front of them.

1100
01:39:21,990 --> 01:39:23,880
My side is apparent.

1101
01:39:26,150 --> 01:39:28,710
Rather, you are the ones who
must choose your side

1102
01:39:29,080 --> 01:39:30,910
Karasi Bey is waiting for you.

1103
01:39:31,720 --> 01:39:33,110
This way.

1104
01:39:59,150 --> 01:40:00,950
It happened because of me.

1105
01:40:01,940 --> 01:40:03,950
I caused this, brother.

1106
01:40:04,300 --> 01:40:05,890
Because of me.

1107
01:40:06,760 --> 01:40:08,810
It is not your fault, my brother.

1108
01:40:09,390 --> 01:40:11,250
You have no fault at all.

1109
01:40:11,660 --> 01:40:13,520
I caused this.

1110
01:40:13,630 --> 01:40:15,420
I hurt you.

1111
01:40:15,560 --> 01:40:17,350
I poisoned you.

1112
01:40:17,770 --> 01:40:19,630
I did this.

1113
01:40:21,200 --> 01:40:23,040
I did this.

1114
01:40:28,330 --> 01:40:30,340
Come to your senses, Aladdin!

1115
01:40:30,780 --> 01:40:35,190
Now go investigate everyone
in the tribe and find out who did this, come on.

1116
01:40:38,760 --> 01:40:40,920
I'm going to find out who did this, brother.

1117
01:40:43,540 --> 01:40:44,940
I will find them.

1118
01:40:55,000 --> 01:40:58,280
Drink this, Orhan Bey,
it'll heal you inshallah.

1119
01:40:58,570 --> 01:41:00,080
Inshallah!

1120
01:41:00,340 --> 01:41:02,140
O Healer!
(one of Allah's names)

1121
01:41:02,140 --> 01:41:04,360
In the name of Allah, the Most Gracious,
the Most Merciful.

1122
01:41:04,360 --> 01:41:05,550
Heal him, my Allah.

1123
01:41:18,005 --> 01:41:20,735
Can this Priest Hristo be trusted?

1124
01:41:21,265 --> 01:41:24,805
Will he help us, Cerkutay?

1125
01:41:25,875 --> 01:41:29,385
Priest Hristo helped us a lot
in Inegol.

1126
01:41:30,135 --> 01:41:34,185
He must have set off as soon as
he got the compass.

1127
01:41:37,175 --> 01:41:42,015
Osman Bey values Priest Hristo a lot.

1128
01:41:43,045 --> 01:41:44,635
I hope so.

1129
01:41:46,885 --> 01:41:48,425
He is coming.

1130
01:41:51,185 --> 01:41:55,825
For the sake of Jesus Christ! I have prepared
your place as soon as I read the letter you sent

1131
01:41:55,825 --> 01:41:58,715
I knew that Osman Bey would not leave
Inegol in the hands of those oppressors.

1132
01:41:58,965 --> 01:42:04,095
Olof called all the priests and nuns
to Inegol.

1133
01:42:04,835 --> 01:42:07,245
Let us enter like we are one of you.

1134
01:42:08,715 --> 01:42:11,095
I obey Osman Bey's orders surely.

1135
01:42:11,535 --> 01:42:15,735
Now put on these clothes.
No one will suspect your identities

1136
01:42:29,795 --> 01:42:33,195
Let's go to church immediately,
for the sake of Jesus Christ.

1137
01:42:33,625 --> 01:42:37,695
I missed Jesus Christ and his love.

1138
01:42:41,665 --> 01:42:45,925
Nice to meet you Nun Irene.
I am Priest Simon.

1139
01:42:49,145 --> 01:42:50,155
Eh.

1140
01:42:53,215 --> 01:42:55,565
Welcome, welcome but..

1141
01:42:56,235 --> 01:42:59,285
What do we owe this visit, Osman Bey?

1142
01:43:00,505 --> 01:43:04,945
I wanted to consolidate our friendship with you
so that we could become one man at heart

1143
01:43:07,435 --> 01:43:08,935
But I see...

1144
01:43:08,985 --> 01:43:13,845
...that there are those who
forged their friendship with you before us

1145
01:43:13,995 --> 01:43:15,865
Not at all, Osman Bey.

1146
01:43:16,615 --> 01:43:22,805
Let's say that whoever moved early
won the Bey's heart.

1147
01:43:25,775 --> 01:43:30,275
And of course we will all be together
against the infidels.

1148
01:43:30,975 --> 01:43:35,285
You are stroking your beard, Bayindir Bey.

1149
01:43:37,135 --> 01:43:43,745
Eyvallah, Eyvallah.
Give him his present.

1150
01:44:13,555 --> 01:44:16,175
May Allah bless you.

1151
01:44:20,575 --> 01:44:24,335
Thank you for your gift.

1152
01:44:27,135 --> 01:44:29,355
My gift is not just this

1153
01:44:31,315 --> 01:44:32,885
Boran.

1154
01:44:58,515 --> 01:45:03,495
I will give you four sites...

1155
01:45:05,975 --> 01:45:08,255
...of my property, Karasi Bey.

1156
01:45:12,745 --> 01:45:16,275
...with their taxes and people...

1157
01:45:17,015 --> 01:45:19,125
...they are under your control from now on.

1158
01:45:20,115 --> 01:45:24,305
We know very well how much suffering you
endured to obtain this property.

1159
01:45:25,275 --> 01:45:28,865
You do not give your property so easily,
so what prompted you to do so?

1160
01:45:30,295 --> 01:45:33,385
I need you on my side against
Commander Nayman.

1161
01:45:35,395 --> 01:45:37,445
And I ask for your help.

1162
01:45:44,665 --> 01:45:48,255
So you give me your property for this?

1163
01:45:50,145 --> 01:45:51,525
Correct

1164
01:45:55,025 --> 01:45:58,055
My only concern is the safety of my poeple.

1165
01:45:58,755 --> 01:46:04,105
For my people I take lands,
I give lands.

1166
01:46:08,275 --> 01:46:12,305
So, these sites are going
to belong to me.

1167
01:46:14,595 --> 01:46:16,125
Certainly

1168
01:46:16,245 --> 01:46:20,525
The location of the Black Tree and its
vicinity are all yours.

1169
01:46:25,745 --> 01:46:26,915
May Allah bless you

1170
01:46:28,405 --> 01:46:35,135
But I won't sacrifice my alps and my weapons for
a war we cannot win, Osman bey.

1171
01:46:44,025 --> 01:46:50,835
Well, what will your
father Kalemsah say about this?

1172
01:46:57,185 --> 01:46:59,375
My father is resting.

1173
01:47:00,635 --> 01:47:04,275
For a long time now
he counts my words as his words

1174
01:47:08,465 --> 01:47:09,975
Eyvallah (okay).

1175
01:47:10,675 --> 01:47:13,755
Father, those lands
are under Byzantium rule

1176
01:47:16,155 --> 01:47:17,745
Osman Bey?

1177
01:47:18,945 --> 01:47:20,555
True.

1178
01:47:21,855 --> 01:47:25,165
I knew from the start that
you wouldn't support me.

1179
01:47:26,655 --> 01:47:29,675
Now that I'm fighting Nayman alone,
Byzantium lands are yours.

1180
01:47:30,005 --> 01:47:33,935
Let the borders of (Byzantium) be yours then

1181
01:47:35,975 --> 01:47:42,625
While I am busy with them,
you'll watch my back.

1182
01:47:46,275 --> 01:47:49,865
You can't force me into this fire!

1183
01:47:51,555 --> 01:47:52,915
No.

1184
01:47:54,455 --> 01:47:57,035
I'm not forcing you into the fire.

1185
01:47:59,305 --> 01:48:01,225
Either you fight Byzantium.

1186
01:48:04,725 --> 01:48:06,995
Or you fight me.

1187
01:48:12,305 --> 01:48:17,985
While my homeland is on fire,
no one can sit comfortably in his palace.

1188
01:48:21,365 --> 01:48:26,065
Osman Bey, we also love to conquer.

1189
01:48:26,465 --> 01:48:29,035
No one gave us our property.

1190
01:48:29,915 --> 01:48:35,085
Whenever we mount our horses,
we lead them to the west and north

1191
01:48:35,475 --> 01:48:38,225
How do you think we got our lands, Uslu Bey?

1192
01:48:39,235 --> 01:48:40,935
We all have fought.

1193
01:48:42,455 --> 01:48:44,965
Now is the time to preserve
our acquired possessions.

1194
01:48:44,965 --> 01:48:48,905
You need to shut up. Don't trust your uncle.
Don't interfere with our conversation.

1195
01:48:49,725 --> 01:48:51,955
Look who is telling me to shut up!

1196
01:48:53,935 --> 01:48:57,165
I want to see your courage
on battlefield against Mongols.

1197
01:48:57,305 --> 01:48:58,515
Forget the Mongols!

1198
01:48:59,865 --> 01:49:03,255
Defend Inegol first,
which your father took with his own blood.

1199
01:49:05,285 --> 01:49:08,815
A man who couldn't defend his father's land
cannot talk to me like that.

1200
01:49:09,555 --> 01:49:11,365
- Uslu!
- Aktemur!

1201
01:49:12,065 --> 01:49:13,635
Stop.

1202
01:49:14,945 --> 01:49:20,005
Weigh your words before you speak them,
so that you do not exceed your limits.

1203
01:49:31,155 --> 01:49:35,495
Stop, Osman Bey,
we'll have a talk.

1204
01:49:36,155 --> 01:49:37,855
I haven't decided yet.

1205
01:49:39,465 --> 01:49:42,155
Make up your mind quickly,
Karasi Bey.

1206
01:49:43,995 --> 01:49:49,385
We respect you and want you to
support us.

1207
01:49:50,005 --> 01:49:54,585
You want us to support you
or fight you.

1208
01:49:55,525 --> 01:49:57,535
There is no other option.

1209
01:50:01,415 --> 01:50:05,935
Be my guest tonight
and I will tell you my decision at midnight.

1210
01:50:08,745 --> 01:50:10,275
Eyvallah (okay)

1211
01:50:14,165 --> 01:50:15,545
Eyvallah.

1212
01:50:15,625 --> 01:50:20,725
Uslu, prepare a room for
Osman Bey and his alps.

1213
01:50:21,155 --> 01:50:23,745
Host them in the best manner.

1214
01:50:45,685 --> 01:50:49,725
Osman Bey is a great Bey.

1215
01:50:50,645 --> 01:50:54,235
A brave Beys whose actions
match his words.

1216
01:50:56,335 --> 01:50:58,575
...but Aktemur.

1217
01:50:58,575 --> 01:51:06,365
His anger will put
mighty Osman Bey in a difficult position.

1218
01:51:06,365 --> 01:51:08,365
He did not hesitate in his words.

1219
01:51:09,815 --> 01:51:11,775
He is a barve man.

1220
01:51:20,745 --> 01:51:24,525
We made our offer.
Decision is yours, my Bey.

1221
01:51:36,165 --> 01:51:41,955
O Allah, O Allah!
My Allah! My Allah!

1222
01:51:47,065 --> 01:51:53,175
O Isra! O Isra! O Isra!

1223
01:51:59,855 --> 01:52:07,045
O Allah, O Allah!
O Allah, O Allah!

1224
01:52:09,625 --> 01:52:16,375
My heart is burning, my heart is burning!

1225
01:52:16,745 --> 01:52:20,655
Extinguish this fire inside me, my Allah!

1226
01:52:21,665 --> 01:52:28,815
Help me my Allah!
Help my son.

1227
01:52:28,815 --> 01:52:33,325
My son!
My light!

1228
01:52:34,135 --> 01:52:36,165
He is slipping away, my Allah!

1229
01:52:36,465 --> 01:52:40,745
He is melting in front of my eyes!

1230
01:52:46,465 --> 01:52:51,095
I can't do anything for
my son, my Allah, please, you help him

1231
01:52:51,095 --> 01:52:54,055
Mitigate his pain.

1232
01:52:54,055 --> 01:52:58,285
Give him strength and health, please.

1233
01:53:03,135 --> 01:53:10,705
My Creator, my Creator, You don't give
anyone unbearable pain, my Allah.

1234
01:53:12,005 --> 01:53:15,005
This exam is so heavy!

1235
01:53:17,975 --> 01:53:21,575
Allah, this burden is too heavy for me!

1236
01:53:21,905 --> 01:53:27,445
Please help, please, give me my son!

1237
01:53:27,915 --> 01:53:30,855
Please, spare my son's life, my Allah.

1238
01:53:31,495 --> 01:53:33,525
You are the healer.

1239
01:53:34,845 --> 01:53:39,935
Grant healing to my son, O Allah,
grant healing to all our patients

1240
01:53:40,265 --> 01:53:45,345
Accept my prayers, please accept my prayers

1241
01:53:45,855 --> 01:53:48,985
Spare my son's life.

1242
01:53:50,985 --> 01:53:56,015
Amen, my Allah!
Amen, Amen!

1243
01:53:56,685 --> 01:53:58,945
Can I come in, daughter?

1244
01:54:00,245 --> 01:54:03,845
Of course, my sheik.
Come in.

1245
01:54:05,945 --> 01:54:08,615
In The Name of Allah Most Gracious Most Merciful.

1246
01:54:12,095 --> 01:54:13,435
Peace be upon you.

1247
01:54:14,465 --> 01:54:16,035
Peace be upon you, too my sheikh.

1248
01:54:20,305 --> 01:54:23,485
In The Name of Allah Most Gracious Most Merciful.

1249
01:54:25,485 --> 01:54:27,145
Please, daughter.

1250
01:54:31,065 --> 01:54:32,335
My sheikh!

1251
01:54:36,495 --> 01:54:42,365
Yes, our Allah who knows us
better than ourselves.

1252
01:54:45,225 --> 01:54:47,585
Didn't he say in his verse?

1253
01:54:48,615 --> 01:55:06,145
“And know that your wealth and your children are a trial,
and that God has a great reward with Him.”

1254
01:55:08,025 --> 01:55:11,525
So don't forget, my daughter, Malhun.

1255
01:55:14,655 --> 01:55:17,165
Children are exams.

1256
01:55:18,465 --> 01:55:23,095
Especially for a mother, the biggest test
is her children.

1257
01:55:28,105 --> 01:55:35,575
you know?
We get closer to our Lord the more our test grows

1258
01:55:37,575 --> 01:55:41,605
...I know, Sheikh, I know, but

1259
01:55:43,245 --> 01:55:45,825
My heart hurts so much.

1260
01:55:48,095 --> 01:55:53,365
He has the cure, daughter.
The One who gives the calamity has the cure.

1261
01:55:54,405 --> 01:55:59,285
Our hearts cannot be at peace
unless we turn to Him.

1262
01:56:03,135 --> 01:56:12,205
Think, Allah tested his prophets with
the most difficult tests

1263
01:56:12,615 --> 01:56:14,425
The ones who He loved the most.

1264
01:56:16,025 --> 01:56:19,605
Think about this even if your heart is burning.

1265
01:56:22,615 --> 01:56:26,495
And be patient in the best way, my daughter.

1266
01:56:28,495 --> 01:56:34,165
And I say this to myself...
be patient and be strong, but...

1267
01:56:35,085 --> 01:56:38,645
How will I be patient when the
exam is my son, my sheikh?

1268
01:56:39,455 --> 01:56:43,105
What strengthens patience is worship

1269
01:56:44,745 --> 01:56:49,145
Increase your worship and insist in your prayers

1270
01:56:49,705 --> 01:56:53,285
Ask, ask your Allah

1271
01:56:54,825 --> 01:56:58,485
Ask for heal, ask for relief

1272
01:56:59,285 --> 01:57:03,285
He does not turn His servants away from His door

1273
01:57:03,985 --> 01:57:08,005
What importance would
remain for us without our prayers?

1274
01:57:09,015 --> 01:57:14,205
Our servitude is hidden in
our worship and prayers, my daughter

1275
01:57:19,305 --> 01:57:27,145
We will first ask for good health for
our son Orhan from our Creator.

1276
01:57:27,145 --> 01:57:28,575
Inshallah.

1277
01:57:29,905 --> 01:57:33,095
This is an exam.

1278
01:57:34,485 --> 01:57:38,705
We will live with everything
that comes to us from our Creator.

1279
01:57:39,945 --> 01:57:43,485
We will not disobey.

1280
01:57:45,765 --> 01:57:49,605
We will consider everything that comes from
Him is beautiful.

1281
01:57:50,535 --> 01:57:57,945
We will say:
“You are the one who gave and you are the one who will take"

1282
01:57:59,895 --> 01:58:04,865
But we will keep our hearts strong as well.

1283
01:58:06,665 --> 01:58:10,535
Wasn't He the one who granted Eyup,
peace be upon him, the cure?

1284
01:58:13,025 --> 01:58:17,135
We will pray, daughter.

1285
01:58:18,265 --> 01:58:19,855
We will be patient.

1286
01:58:24,085 --> 01:58:27,715
Praise be to Allah, my sheikh, praise be to Allah.

1287
01:58:29,115 --> 01:58:33,125
My hope in my Creator
is not interrupted even for a moment.

1288
01:58:33,125 --> 01:58:37,055
His presence is on my tongue and in my heart.

1289
01:58:37,405 --> 01:58:43,175
I know my dear Orhan will be fine.
My Creator will heal him.

1290
01:58:44,555 --> 01:58:46,085
Inshallah.

1291
01:58:49,675 --> 01:58:52,495
Inegol Castle.

1292
01:58:55,785 --> 01:58:58,845
Cerkutay, what are we going to do now?

1293
01:59:02,440 --> 01:59:06,480
Watch me, do what I do.

1294
01:59:09,185 --> 01:59:12,695
They say something, what do they say?
We can't recite surahs!

1295
01:59:13,925 --> 01:59:16,065
Sing a song.

1296
01:59:16,975 --> 01:59:18,465
- A song?
- Yes

1297
01:59:24,055 --> 01:59:32,775
Bring henna, mother, bring henna, mother!

1298
01:59:32,975 --> 01:59:34,975
- Bring henna, mother.
- Ulgen!

1299
01:59:34,975 --> 01:59:36,985
Is my voice bad?

1300
01:59:37,075 --> 01:59:37,965
What?

1301
01:59:37,975 --> 01:59:39,125
Move your lips.

1302
01:59:39,125 --> 01:59:40,985
Okay.

1303
01:59:40,985 --> 01:59:47,285
Bring the henna, mother, bring the henna

1304
01:59:47,285 --> 01:59:48,805
Friends!

1305
01:59:50,805 --> 01:59:53,695
- Amen.
- Amen.

1306
01:59:55,215 --> 01:59:59,225
- Amen.
- Amen.

1307
02:00:02,375 --> 02:00:07,055
O Jesus Christ,
sanctify us with your love and light.

1308
02:00:07,055 --> 02:00:11,985
We promise to be as faithful to
you as to your disciples.

1309
02:00:11,985 --> 02:00:14,885
Hear our supplication, Amen.

1310
02:00:14,885 --> 02:00:18,795
- Amen.
- Amen.

1311
02:00:58,345 --> 02:01:01,445
May Jesus Christ accept your prayers.

1312
02:01:01,445 --> 02:01:03,975
My religion fellows!

1313
02:01:06,565 --> 02:01:10,695
It hasn't been long since I accepted
your religion.

1314
02:01:11,485 --> 02:01:18,205
But the love of Jesus inside me
is so strong.

1315
02:01:20,925 --> 02:01:23,175
I took Inegol from Turks.

1316
02:01:24,705 --> 02:01:30,965
Christianity will live its good
old days here again.

1317
02:01:31,445 --> 02:01:37,975
You play the biggest role in this.

1318
02:01:57,040 --> 02:01:58,600
Aladdin!

1319
02:02:01,650 --> 02:02:05,020
See, brother?
I can move my hand.

1320
02:02:06,650 --> 02:02:10,810
I told you, I told you Kumral Abdal
would heal you.

1321
02:02:15,740 --> 02:02:17,500
Come on, let's show it to our mothers.

1322
02:02:17,500 --> 02:02:21,530
Stop, stop, brother, don't get up so fast.

1323
02:02:22,450 --> 02:02:24,140
I will call them.

1324
02:02:24,460 --> 02:02:30,720
No, brother, I upset them, so let
us go to them.

1325
02:02:39,850 --> 02:02:46,890
This place will be the largest
and grandest church in this area

1326
02:02:47,320 --> 02:02:55,970
And the army that will fight for Jesus will be raised
in this church and in the monastery in Inegol

1327
02:02:56,700 --> 02:02:59,000
I called you for this.

1328
02:02:59,000 --> 02:03:05,320
You will do everything
in your hands for this cause.

1329
02:03:08,320 --> 02:03:13,420
Inegol will become one of
the centers of Christianity

1330
02:03:18,360 --> 02:03:21,740
Where do we start, Priest Hristo?

1331
02:03:21,740 --> 02:03:26,400
If your goal is to make
your army a true Christian army...

1332
02:03:27,000 --> 02:03:32,680
Your entire army must consist only Christians.
No other religion can be accepted.

1333
02:03:34,080 --> 02:03:35,940
Does everyone think this way?

1334
02:03:35,940 --> 02:03:37,940
Priest Hristo is right

1335
02:03:38,200 --> 02:03:41,120
The entire army must be Christian.

1336
02:03:43,440 --> 02:03:44,960
What about you?

1337
02:03:46,220 --> 02:03:51,960
Oh, the eye of the devil!

1338
02:03:51,960 --> 02:03:55,000
Jesus Christ, Holy Mary.

1339
02:03:57,720 --> 02:04:03,900
Don't get me wrong, this is my favorite church
I haven't been to in a long time.

1340
02:04:04,480 --> 02:04:08,220
May Jesus be pleased with you

1341
02:04:11,370 --> 02:04:14,700
Nun Irene is also
among my old students.

1342
02:04:15,080 --> 02:04:18,140
She grew up here too, in Ingol Abbey.

1343
02:04:21,650 --> 02:04:22,960
If so...

1344
02:04:23,470 --> 02:04:30,480
You must want the things I want
more than I do, Nun Irene.

1345
02:04:30,480 --> 02:04:32,380
We do very much!

1346
02:04:34,250 --> 02:04:38,620
Beautiful, beautiful.

1347
02:04:43,400 --> 02:04:46,470
Karesiogullari Beyship
Karesi Bey Mansion

1348
02:04:48,385 --> 02:04:51,465
- Here, my Bey.
- Give it to me, brother. Thanks.

1349
02:04:54,495 --> 02:04:58,705
My Bey, will Karasi Bey agree with us?

1350
02:04:58,975 --> 02:05:02,145
Thank Allah, thank Allah.

1351
02:05:05,725 --> 02:05:12,645
His heart and mind accepted
supporting us a long time ago.

1352
02:05:13,085 --> 02:05:16,495
All that remains is to hear and agree.

1353
02:05:17,445 --> 02:05:20,785
My Bey, I have the information.

1354
02:05:21,765 --> 02:05:27,205
In Karasi Beyshio, there is 6,000 alps.

1355
02:05:28,475 --> 02:05:30,385
I don't know how many of them will join.

1356
02:05:30,575 --> 02:05:31,985
As for Candar...

1357
02:05:32,015 --> 02:05:33,615
He has 3,000 alps maximum.

1358
02:05:35,285 --> 02:05:37,675
You're only talking about the qualified alps.

1359
02:05:38,175 --> 02:05:39,555
You don't count the sisters.

1360
02:05:39,715 --> 02:05:41,125
You don't count the elders.

1361
02:05:41,215 --> 02:05:43,045
When it's the war against infidels...

1362
02:05:43,245 --> 02:05:45,955
They will give us the double you say.

1363
02:05:46,535 --> 02:05:49,275
Still, we're not as half crowded as
Nayman, brother.

1364
02:05:49,385 --> 02:05:52,905
We can't fight Neyman without
Germiyans.

1365
02:05:53,115 --> 02:05:56,395
Many times,
a few defeated the many, Aykurt.

1366
02:05:58,035 --> 02:05:59,395
Don't worry.

1367
02:06:02,265 --> 02:06:04,955
We will have Germiyan Yakup Bey's
support, inshallah.

1368
02:06:05,085 --> 02:06:07,105
- Inshallah
- Inshallah.

1369
02:06:07,215 --> 02:06:08,805
How will this happen, my Bey?

1370
02:06:08,895 --> 02:06:11,145
We will act according to their mood, Gurbuz.

1371
02:06:11,485 --> 02:06:14,615
We did a lot of campaigns in order to
unite with a lot of Beys.

1372
02:06:14,795 --> 02:06:19,925
Inshallah, we have a move
for Germiyans as well.

1373
02:06:22,275 --> 02:06:27,065
If we have Germiyans as well,
the enemy must be worried!

1374
02:06:28,625 --> 02:06:30,945
Perhaps good resides in evil.

1375
02:06:32,225 --> 02:06:34,825
This won't be just a victory against Nayman.

1376
02:06:34,945 --> 02:06:38,855
Rather, it will be good for
the unity of our country, Inshallah.

1377
02:06:38,995 --> 02:06:41,045
- Inshallah.
- Inshallah, my Bey.

1378
02:06:41,195 --> 02:06:43,125
Inshallah.

1379
02:06:44,675 --> 02:06:45,825
Where's Aktemur?

1380
02:06:45,945 --> 02:06:48,465
Subasi went to check on the soldiers, my Bey.

1381
02:06:49,055 --> 02:06:50,915
You know, we're in foreign lands.

1382
02:06:50,965 --> 02:06:52,835
He wants everyone to be careful.

1383
02:06:53,625 --> 02:06:55,405
Yes, we are in foreign lands.

1384
02:06:55,425 --> 02:06:57,425
We shouldn't stay too far away.

1385
02:06:57,705 --> 02:06:59,265
Eyvallah my Bey.

1386
02:07:14,985 --> 02:07:16,565
There he is, Aktemur.

1387
02:07:16,595 --> 02:07:18,925
Come on, show yourself.

1388
02:07:30,305 --> 02:07:31,835
Aktemur Bey.

1389
02:07:37,025 --> 02:07:38,775
Uslu Bey wants to see you.

1390
02:07:38,865 --> 02:07:40,965
He set a table in his room for you.

1391
02:07:44,005 --> 02:07:45,305
Thank him.

1392
02:07:46,055 --> 02:07:47,785
But I'm not hungry.

1393
02:07:47,825 --> 02:07:49,585
Tell him I won't come.

1394
02:07:49,675 --> 02:07:50,965
It is the order of the Bey.

1395
02:07:50,975 --> 02:07:53,235
I can't go tell him you're not coming.

1396
02:07:53,265 --> 02:07:55,025
Please, my Bey.

1397
02:07:55,245 --> 02:07:57,265
Don't make Uslu Bey mad at me.

1398
02:07:58,695 --> 02:07:59,995
Okay.

1399
02:08:01,055 --> 02:08:03,075
Let's go and sit at your Bey's table.

1400
02:08:03,095 --> 02:08:04,655
This way, my Bey.

1401
02:08:08,785 --> 02:08:10,835
We interrogated everyone in the tribe

1402
02:08:10,905 --> 02:08:14,225
But no one
ever saw a stranger in

1403
02:08:15,305 --> 02:08:17,505
So, the traitor is among us.

1404
02:08:19,255 --> 02:08:24,025
Since Ismihan has connections everywhere,
she must be informed about our moves.

1405
02:08:31,965 --> 02:08:33,485
Mother.

1406
02:08:38,365 --> 02:08:39,895
Orhan.

1407
02:08:43,325 --> 02:08:45,215
I can move my hands.

1408
02:08:46,615 --> 02:08:48,345
I'm fine, Thank Allah.

1409
02:08:48,375 --> 02:08:49,895
Thank Allah.

1410
02:08:50,785 --> 02:08:52,965
Praise be to Allah, my son

1411
02:08:57,495 --> 02:08:58,725
Thank Allah!

1412
02:08:59,845 --> 02:09:03,305
My Allah!
Thank Allah!

1413
02:09:05,735 --> 02:09:07,275
Praise be!

1414
02:09:07,535 --> 02:09:09,905
Kumral Abdal's cure worked!

1415
02:09:10,775 --> 02:09:12,285
Orhan.

1416
02:09:18,985 --> 02:09:20,495
Orhan.

1417
02:09:21,395 --> 02:09:22,715
Mother.

1418
02:09:22,905 --> 02:09:24,205
Mother.

1419
02:09:24,505 --> 02:09:25,805
Mother.

1420
02:09:25,815 --> 02:09:26,585
Orhan!

1421
02:09:26,605 --> 02:09:28,335
- Orhan!
- Orhan!

1422
02:09:28,355 --> 02:09:29,875
Orhan!

1423
02:09:30,975 --> 02:09:32,985
I can't feel any part of my body, mother!

1424
02:09:33,535 --> 02:09:34,665
Mother!

1425
02:09:35,085 --> 02:09:36,595
I can't move, mother!

1426
02:09:37,065 --> 02:09:39,565
I can't move, mother!

1427
02:09:39,865 --> 02:09:41,155
Do something, mother.

1428
02:09:44,845 --> 02:09:46,925
esma, run and tell Komral Abdul.

1429
02:09:47,005 --> 02:09:48,315
Hurry!

1430
02:09:49,235 --> 02:09:51,745
Come on, hurry up, come on!

1431
02:09:53,565 --> 02:09:55,625
Mother I can't move! Mother1

1432
02:09:55,985 --> 02:09:57,085
Mother!

1433
02:09:58,005 --> 02:10:01,095
It will pass, it will pass,
Orhan, calm down, it will pass

1434
02:10:03,985 --> 02:10:05,915
I can't move, mother!

1435
02:10:08,075 --> 02:10:09,135
Mother!

1436
02:10:11,215 --> 02:10:14,635
What have you done
without my information, Bengi?

1437
02:10:15,135 --> 02:10:17,335
Using Esma as a spy?

1438
02:10:17,445 --> 02:10:21,685
I sent Esma just to
get news from the palace

1439
02:10:21,815 --> 02:10:23,515
Not to kill anyone

1440
02:10:23,535 --> 02:10:25,245
if I had known this would happen...

1441
02:10:25,315 --> 02:10:27,145
The one who is afraid of killing..

1442
02:10:29,255 --> 02:10:32,455
...cannot rule, Bengi Hatun.

1443
02:10:38,155 --> 02:10:40,375
This is a heavy statement, Mother Sultan.

1444
02:10:43,485 --> 02:10:46,125
We cannot pay for this sin.

1445
02:10:46,295 --> 02:10:50,965
Oktem Bey, you want to rule Kayi.

1446
02:10:51,475 --> 02:10:55,495
At the same time,
you want to stay away from blood.

1447
02:10:56,855 --> 02:11:02,475
If you want to rule, you will
stain your hands with blood and dirt.

1448
02:11:04,105 --> 02:11:07,445
Should Orhan die
in order to rule the Kayi?

1449
02:11:09,795 --> 02:11:11,445
You could have banished him

1450
02:11:11,865 --> 02:11:12,925
or find another solution...

1451
02:11:12,925 --> 02:11:15,195
What is this, Bengi Hatun?

1452
02:11:18,265 --> 02:11:21,295
Do you pity the enemy now?

1453
02:11:24,225 --> 02:11:29,875
In order for Aktemur to ascend the throne,
Osman's sons must be removed.

1454
02:11:31,935 --> 02:11:34,085
I say this for your own good.

1455
02:11:36,655 --> 02:11:38,895
What will happen to Orhan?

1456
02:11:39,325 --> 02:11:41,375
Will he die, Mother Sultan?

1457
02:11:42,925 --> 02:11:45,855
You two think I'm evil.

1458
02:11:48,505 --> 02:11:50,085
I am a mother too.

1459
02:11:52,145 --> 02:11:54,715
Orhan will not die.

1460
02:12:00,485 --> 02:12:02,905
He'll be worse than dead.

1461
02:12:06,685 --> 02:12:09,155
He will not be able to walk from now on.

1462
02:12:12,435 --> 02:12:14,695
Orhan will always be bedridden.

1463
02:12:29,685 --> 02:12:32,745
Can I come in, Uslu Bey?
Aktemur Bey is here.

1464
02:12:33,195 --> 02:12:34,545
Enter!

1465
02:12:57,015 --> 02:12:58,785
Uslu Bey.

1466
02:12:59,785 --> 02:13:02,595
Uslu Bey is dead.
He can't hear you.

1467
02:13:14,195 --> 02:13:15,955
Whose dog are you?

1468
02:13:16,275 --> 02:13:18,065
Who do you work for?

1469
02:13:19,185 --> 02:13:21,225
Forget who we are.

1470
02:13:21,545 --> 02:13:24,985
Soon we will be the brave alps
who saw how you killed Uslu Bey.

1471
02:13:24,985 --> 02:13:27,755
We'll be the alps who
will tell Karasi Bey about this.

1472
02:13:27,755 --> 02:13:29,785
You will not be able to reach your goal.

1473
02:13:29,985 --> 02:13:31,635
I will not allow this.

1474
02:13:42,855 --> 02:13:44,615
So, Osman Bey.

1475
02:13:45,845 --> 02:13:47,985
You convinced Candar Bey.

1476
02:13:49,095 --> 02:13:53,065
And you came to my palace and persuaded me

1477
02:13:53,925 --> 02:13:59,325
Tell me, how will you persuade Yakup Bey
in Germiyan city?

1478
02:13:59,795 --> 02:14:03,155
How are you going to convince that hard man?

1479
02:14:03,915 --> 02:14:06,115
We don't convince anyone.

1480
02:14:09,625 --> 02:14:12,905
He who does not have the fire of war
in his heart can never ignite it

1481
02:14:14,245 --> 02:14:18,925
We certainly erased a lot of hard men.

1482
02:14:19,685 --> 02:14:23,555
Yakup Bey's tribe has been fighting
the infidels for a hundred years.

1483
02:14:25,015 --> 02:14:28,445
Indeed, we have taken a huge mountain
like you against the enemy

1484
02:14:28,585 --> 02:14:29,675
Inshallah.

1485
02:14:30,375 --> 02:14:32,885
Inshallah, everything goes well
with Yakup Bey too.

1486
02:14:33,135 --> 02:14:34,645
Don't worry.

1487
02:14:36,375 --> 02:14:37,915
We will win.

1488
02:14:43,585 --> 02:14:44,785
Come on.

1489
02:14:50,715 --> 02:14:53,275
In The Name of Allah Most Gracious Most Merciful

1490
02:15:05,035 --> 02:15:07,535
In The Name of Allah Most Gracious Most Merciful

1491
02:15:08,725 --> 02:15:10,795
May I come in, my Bey?

1492
02:15:14,235 --> 02:15:15,385
Enter!

1493
02:15:19,085 --> 02:15:21,715
Sir, we have heard sword sounds
in Uslu Bey's room.

1494
02:15:21,825 --> 02:15:23,175
The door is locked.

1495
02:16:46,334 --> 02:16:48,575
I considered you my son.

1496
02:16:50,684 --> 02:16:51,974
Uslu!

1497
02:16:57,844 --> 02:17:01,025
Aktemur, what's going on here?

1498
02:17:01,184 --> 02:17:02,564
It's a trick, my Bey!

1499
02:17:03,295 --> 02:17:04,905
They set up a trick!

1500
02:17:06,495 --> 02:17:09,064
What have you done, Aktemur?

1501
02:17:09,484 --> 02:17:13,605
You killed my son-in-law,
whom I consider my son!

1502
02:17:13,764 --> 02:17:15,165
No!

1503
02:17:16,415 --> 02:17:19,424
It is impossible for something like this
to happen where we are guests!

1504
02:17:19,605 --> 02:17:22,974
Your nephew couldn't take
the speech, Osman Bey!

1505
02:17:23,304 --> 02:17:25,304
For this reason, he shed my blood!

1506
02:17:25,504 --> 02:17:27,384
He burned my soul!

1507
02:17:27,564 --> 02:17:30,275
And I will kill him!

1508
02:17:32,064 --> 02:17:33,915
Nothing like this will happen!

1509
02:17:37,054 --> 02:17:39,615
Aktemur is not such a man.

1510
02:17:40,264 --> 02:17:43,125
But if you still want to fight.

1511
02:17:43,894 --> 02:17:46,474
You must kill me first.

1512
02:17:57,635 --> 02:18:07,705
Visit our website for more: turkision.com